    {"^Damage and healing done increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. This effect is increased by nearby positively charged allies%.\n\nDeals ([%d%.,%-]+) damage to nearby allies that are not positively charged every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%.$", "Skade og heling forvoldt øget med {1}%. Denne effekt øges af nærliggende positivt ladede allierede.\n\nForvolder {2} skade til nærliggende allierede, der ikke er positivt ladede, hver {3} sek.", "%. This effect is increased by nearby positively charged allies.\n\nDeals ", "D"},
