    {"^Increases the Attack Power your Beast pet gains from your attributes by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den Angrebskraft, dit Udyr-kæledyr får fra dine egenskaber, med {1}%.", "Increases the Attack Power your Beast pet gains from your attributes by ", "I"},
