    {"^This upgrade costs fewer (.-) because you have already acquired a weapon set with higher item level %(([%d%.,%-]+)%)%.$", "Denne opgradering koster færre {1}, fordi du allerede har skaffet et våbensæt med højere genstandsniveau ({2}).", " because you have already acquired a weapon set with higher item level (", "T"},
