    {"^Cannot reset (.-)%.  There are players in your party attempting to zone into an instance%.$", "Kan ikke nulstille {1}.  Der er spillere i din gruppe, som forsøger at gå ind i en instans.", ".  There are players in your party attempting to zone into an instance.", "C"},
