    {"^Hits an enemy with a bolt of draining arcane power that consumes up to ([%d%.,%-]+) mana%.$", "Rammer en fjende med et lyn af drænende arkan kraft, som forbruger op til {1} mana.", "Hits an enemy with a bolt of draining arcane power that consumes up to ", "H"},
    {"^Immune to fear effects%.\nAll attacks do critical hits%.\nArmor reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Immun over for frygt-effekter.\nAlle angreb giver kritiske træf.\nRustning reduceret med {1}%.", "Immune to fear effects.\nAll attacks do critical hits.\nArmor reduced by ", "I"},
