    {"^Causes the enemy target to run in horror for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+) and causes ([%d%.,%-]+) Shadow damage%.  The caster gains 100%% of the damage caused in health%.$", "Forårsager, at det fjendtlige mål løber i rædsel i {1} og forvolder {2} Skyggeskade.  Udøveren får 100% af den forvoldte skade tilbage i helbred.", " Shadow damage.  The caster gains 100% of the damage caused in health.", "C"},
    {"^Chance on harmful spell cast to reduce target enemy's attack power by ([%d%.,%-]+) for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Chance ved skadelig besværgelse for at reducere det fjendtlige måls angrebskraft med {1} i {2}.", "Chance on harmful spell cast to reduce target enemy's attack power by ", "C"},
    {"^Damaging finishing moves have a \n1%% chance per combo point to restore ([%d%.,%-]+) energy%.$", "Skadegivende afslutningstræk har en \n1% chance pr. kombinationspunkt for at genoprette {1} energi.", "Damaging finishing moves have a \n1% chance per combo point to restore ", "D"},
    {"^Deal ([%d%.,%-]+) Shadow damage and increases the target's critical damage received by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% per stack, up to ([%d%.,%-]+) times%.$", "Forvolder {1} Skyggeskade og øger målets modtagne kritiske skade med {2}% pr. stabel, op til {3} gange.", " Shadow damage and increases the target's critical damage received by ", "D"},
    {"^Each time your Lifebloom heals a target, it has a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to make your next Healing Touch, Nourish, or Regrowth within (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+) instant cast%.$", "Hver gang din Livsblomst helbreder et mål, har den en {1}% chance for at gøre din næste Helbredende Berøring, Nærende eller Genvækst til en øjeblikkelig støbning inden for {2}.", "% chance to make your next Healing Touch, Nourish, or Regrowth within ", "E"},
    {"^Health increased in Eastern Plaguelands, Stratholme and Scholmance by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Liv øget i Østlige Pestlande, Stratholm og Skolmance med {1}%.", "Health increased in Eastern Plaguelands, Stratholme and Scholmance by ", "H"},
    {"^In order to use voice chat, you must grant \"Microphone\" permission to (.-) in Security & Privacy preferences, located in System Preferences%.$", "For at bruge stemmechat skal du give {1} tilladelse til \"Mikrofon\" i præferencerne for Sikkerhed & Privatliv, som findes under Systemindstillinger.", "In order to use voice chat, you must grant \"Microphone\" permission to ", "I"},
    {"^Increases Kill Shot's damage against non%-player controlled targets by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger Dræbeskuds skade mod mål, som ikke styres af spillere, med {1}%.", "Increases Kill Shot's damage against non-player controlled targets by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases all damage and healing caused by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.  Causes Forbearance and cannot be used while Forebearance is active%.$", "Øger al forvoldt skade og heling med {1}% i {2}.  Forårsager Overbærenhed og kan ikke bruges mens Overbærenhed er aktiv.", ".  Causes Forbearance and cannot be used while Forebearance is active.", "I"},
    {"^Increases damage done by your Frostbolt and Spellfrost Bolt spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skade forvoldt af dine besværgelser Frostpil og Besværgelsesfrostpil med {1}%.", "Increases damage done by your Frostbolt and Spellfrost Bolt spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Ranged Attack Power bonus of your Aspect of the Hawk by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger bonussen til Distance Angrebskraft fra dit Høgens Aspekt med {1}%.", "Increases the Ranged Attack Power bonus of your Aspect of the Hawk by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the critical strike damage bonus of your melee abilities by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den kritiske angrebsskadesbonus for dine nærkampsevner med {1}%.", "Increases the critical strike damage bonus of your melee abilities by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the critical strike damage bonus on all ranged abilities by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den kritiske angrebsskadesbonus for alle dine distanceevner med {1}%.", "Increases the critical strike damage bonus on all ranged abilities by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the effect of your Amplify Magic and Dampen Magic spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger effekten af dine Forstærk Magi- og Dæmp Magi-besværgelser med {1}%.", "Increases the effect of your Amplify Magic and Dampen Magic spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the target's Mana regeneration by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and allows ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of the target's Mana regeneration to continue while casting%.  Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger målets Mana-genoprettelse med {1}% og lader {2}% af målets Mana-genoprettelse fortsætte under støbning.  Varer {3}.", "% of the target's Mana regeneration to continue while casting.  Lasts ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your critical strike chance with all attacks and Poisons by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din kritiske angrebschance med alle angreb og Gifte med {1}%.", "Increases your critical strike chance with all attacks and Poisons by ", "I"},
    {"^Inflicts ([%d%.,%-]+) Nature damage to nearby enemies, and reduces their movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Påfører {1} naturskade til nærliggende fjender og reducerer deres bevægelseshastighed med {2}% i {3}.", " Nature damage to nearby enemies, and reduces their movement speed by ", "I"},
    {"^Reduces the cast time of Healing Wave by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, reduces the cast time of Chain Heal by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and increases the critical strike chance of Lesser Healing Wave by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer besværgelsestiden for Helbredelsesbølge med {1}%, reducerer besværgelsestiden for Kædehelbred med {2}%, og øger den kritiske angrebschance for Mindre Helbredelsesbølge med {3}%.", "%, and increases the critical strike chance of Lesser Healing Wave by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the cast time of Starfire by %$/1000;S1 sec and Starfire has a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to stun its target for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Reducerer besværgelsestiden for Stjerneild med $/1000;S1 sek., og Stjerneild har en chance på {1}% for at bedøve sit mål i {2}.", "Reduces the cast time of Starfire by $/1000;S1 sec and Starfire has a ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the cooldown on your Fire Nova Totem by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, increases its damage by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and reduces its mana cost by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. Additionally, your Fire Nova Totem now activates instantly on cast%.$", "Reducerer genopladningen på din Ildnova-totem med {1}%, øger dens skade med {2}%, og reducerer dens manaomkostning med {3}%. Derudover aktiveres din Ildnova-totem nu øjeblikkeligt ved kast.", "%. Additionally, your Fire Nova Totem now activates instantly on cast.", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the mana cost of your Healing Touch and Tranquility spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer manaomkostningen for dine Helbredende Berøring- og Ro-besværgelser med {1}%.", "Reduces the mana cost of your Healing Touch and Tranquility spells by ", "R"},
    {"^Returns your totems to the earth, giving you ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of the mana required to cast each totem destroyed by Totemic Recall%.$", "Vender dine totemer tilbage til jorden og giver dig {1}% af den mana der kræves for at besværge hver totem der er ødelagt af Totemist Tilbagekaldelse.", "% of the mana required to cast each totem destroyed by Totemic Recall.", "R"},
    {"^The item level of this reward will be based on the lowest of your top ([%d%.,%-]+) runs this week %(currently Heroic%)%.$", "Genstandsniveauet for denne belønning vil baseres på det laveste af dine bedste {1} kørsler denne uge (aktuelt Heroisk).", "The item level of this reward will be based on the lowest of your top ", "T"},
    {"^The item level of this reward will be based on the lowest of your top ([%d%.,%-]+) runs this week %(currently Mythic Level ([%d%.,%-]+)%)%.$", "Genstandsniveauet for denne belønning vil baseres på det laveste af dine bedste {1} kørsler denne uge (aktuelt Mytisk niveau {2}).", "The item level of this reward will be based on the lowest of your top ", "T"},
    {"^You heal for ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of all damage done by your Corruption%. This healing is increased to ([%d%.,%-]+)%% if the target is also afflicted with your Drain Life%.$", "Du heler for {1}% af al skade forvoldt af din Fordærvelse. Helingen øges til {2}%, hvis målet også er ramt af dit Dræn Liv.", "% of all damage done by your Corruption. This healing is increased to ", "Y"},
    {"^Your Nightfall talent has a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased chance to trigger%. Your Incinerate has a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to trigger your Decimation regardless of the target's health%.$", "Dit Nattefald-talent har en {1}% øget chance for at blive udløst. Din Forbrænding har en {2}% chance for at udløse din Decimering, uanset målets liv.", "% chance to trigger your Decimation regardless of the target's health.", "Y"},
    {"^Your Power Word: Shield has a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to not deplete when the target is damaged by an Undead enemy%.$", "Dit Kraftord: Skjold har en {1}% chance for ikke at blive opbrugt, når målet tager skade fra en udød fjende.", "% chance to not deplete when the target is damaged by an Undead enemy.", "Y"},
    {"^Your character is now locked%. You will be logged out automatically in (.-)%.$", "Din karakter er nu låst. Du bliver automatisk logget af om {1}.", "Your character is now locked. You will be logged out automatically in ", "Y"},
    {"^(.-) can't be promoted to (.-) because that rank requires an Authenticator%. Do you wish to promote (.-) to (.-)%?$", "{1} kan ikke forfremmes til {2}, fordi den rang kræver en Autentificator. Ønsker du at forfremme {3} til {4}?", " because that rank requires an Authenticator. Do you wish to promote ", ""},
    {"^A nearby shrine is dedicated to the Light, increasing your Spirit by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "En nærliggende helligdom er viet til Lyset, hvilket øger din Ånd med {1}%.", "A nearby shrine is dedicated to the Light, increasing your Spirit by ", "A"},
    {"^A vicious strike that deals weapon damage plus ([%d%.,%-]+) and wounds the target, reducing the effectiveness of any healing by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Et ondskabsfuldt stød der forvolder våbenskade plus {1} og sårer målet, hvilket reducerer effekten af enhver heling med {2}% i {3}.", " and wounds the target, reducing the effectiveness of any healing by ", "A"},
    {"^Allows the Druid to prowl around, but reduces your movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.  Lasts until cancelled%.$", "Tillader druiden at liste rundt, men reducerer din bevægelseshastighed med {1}%.  Varer indtil annulleret.", "Allows the Druid to prowl around, but reduces your movement speed by ", "A"},
    {"^Bleeding for ([%d%.,%-]+) damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%.\nDamage taken from Saber Slash and Sinister Strike increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Blødende i {1} skade hvert {2} sek.\nModtaget skade fra Sabel-hug og Uhyggeligt slag øget med {3}%.", " sec.\nDamage taken from Saber Slash and Sinister Strike increased by ", "B"},
    {"^Casting speed of all spells increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and reduces pushback suffered by damaging attacks while casting by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Støbningshastighed for alle besværgelser øget med {1}%, og reducerer tilbageslag fra skadelige angreb under støbning med {2}%.", "% and reduces pushback suffered by damaging attacks while casting by ", "C"},
    {"^Decreases the mana cost of Arcane Intellect and Arcane Brilliance by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Mindsker mana-omkostningen for Arkan Intellekt og Arkan Glans med {1}%.", "Decreases the mana cost of Arcane Intellect and Arcane Brilliance by ", "D"},
    {"^Devour living Slimecontrolled creatures and adventurers, healing for ([%d%.,%-]+)%% maximum health per victim consumed%.$", "Sluger levende slimkontrollerede væsener og eventyrere og helbreder {1}% af maksimalt liv pr. forbrugt offer.", "Devour living Slimecontrolled creatures and adventurers, healing for ", "D"},
    {"^Equip: Decreases healing done by magical spells and effects by up to ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "Udstyr: Mindsker heling forvoldt af magiske besværgelser og effekter med op til {1}.", "Equip: Decreases healing done by magical spells and effects by up to ", "E"},
    {"^Equip: Increases healing done by magical spells and effects by up to ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "Udstyr: Øger heling forvoldt af magiske besværgelser og effekter med op til {1}.", "Equip: Increases healing done by magical spells and effects by up to ", "E"},
    {"^Heals yourself for 15%%, and increases your maximum health by 15%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Helbreder dig selv for 15%, og øger dit maksimale liv med 15% i {1}.", "Heals yourself for 15%, and increases your maximum health by 15% for ", "H"},
    {"^Immune to all attacks and spells, but reduces all damage you deal by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Immun over for alle angreb og besværgelser, men reducerer al skade du forvolder med {1}%.", "Immune to all attacks and spells, but reduces all damage you deal by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases Ambush, Eviscerate, Crimson Tempest, and Envenom damage by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skade fra Baghold, Udtømning, Karmosinrød Storm og Forgiftning med {1}%.", "Increases Ambush, Eviscerate, Crimson Tempest, and Envenom damage by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases Cenarion Circle reputation gained from killing monsters by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger ry opnået hos Cenarion-kredsen ved at dræbe monstre med {1}%.", "Increases Cenarion Circle reputation gained from killing monsters by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases damage done by your melee abilities on Bleeding targets by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skade forvoldt af dine nærkampsevner mod Blødende mål med {1}%.", "Increases damage done by your melee abilities on Bleeding targets by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases effect for your next Curse of Weakness or Bane of Agony by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, or your next Curse of Exhaustion by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger effekten af din næste Forbandelse af Svaghed eller Bane af Kval med {1}%, eller din næste Forbandelse af Udmattelse med {2}%.", "Increases effect for your next Curse of Weakness or Bane of Agony by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases movement speed and mounted movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.  This does not stack with other movement speed increasing effects%.$", "Øger bevægelseshastighed og ridedyrs bevægelseshastighed med {1}%.  Stakker ikke med andre effekter, der øger bevægelseshastighed.", "%.  This does not stack with other movement speed increasing effects.", "I"},
    {"^Increases the critical effect chance of your Flash of Light spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den kritiske effektchance for din Blitz af Let-besværgelse med {1}%.", "Increases the critical effect chance of your Flash of Light spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the critical strike chance of your Lightning Bolt spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den kritiske angrebschance for din Lynbolt-besværgelse med {1}%.", "Increases the critical strike chance of your Lightning Bolt spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage dealt by all of your damage over time spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% per piece of Timeworn armor equipped%.$", "Øger skaden tilføjet af alle dine skade over tid-besværgelser med {1}% pr. stykke udrustet Tidsslidt rustning.", "Increases the damage dealt by all of your damage over time spells by ", "I"},
