    {"^Grants you immunity to Silence and Interrupt effects%.  Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Giver dig immunitet over for Tavshed- og Afbrydelseseffekter.  Varer {1}.", "Grants you immunity to Silence and Interrupt effects.  Lasts ", "G"},
    {"^Improves your chance to get a critical strike with spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Forbedrer din chance for kritisk angreb ved besværgelser med {1}%.", "Improves your chance to get a critical strike with spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases all periodic damage done by your Warlock spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger al periodisk skade forvoldt af dine Hekseleder-besværgelser med {1}%.", "Increases all periodic damage done by your Warlock spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the benefits of your Master Demonologist talent by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger fordelene fra dit Mester Dæmonolog-talent med {1}%.", "Increases the benefits of your Master Demonologist talent by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the bonus damage from Raptor Fury by an additional ([%d%.,%-]+)%% per stack%.$", "Øger bonusskaden fra Rovfugl-Vrede med en ekstra {1}% pr. stabel.", "Increases the bonus damage from Raptor Fury by an additional ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the caster's attack speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. However, the caster becomes fatigued from the extra effort%.$", "Øger udøverens angrebshastighed med {1}% i {2}. Udøveren bliver dog træt af den ekstra indsats.", ". However, the caster becomes fatigued from the extra effort.", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage dealt by your Lightning Shield spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger skaden tilføjet af din Lynskjold-besværgelse med {1}% i {2}.", "Increases the damage dealt by your Lightning Shield spell by ", "I"},
