    {"^Invigorated by stolen souls%. Shadow damage is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Opildnet af stjålne sjæle. Skyggeskade er øget med {1}%.", "Invigorated by stolen souls. Shadow damage is increased by ", "I"},
    {"^Leaps to a target, dealing ([%d%.,%-]+) nature damage and slowing the target and all units within ([%d%.,%-]+) yards by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Springer hen til et mål, påfører {1} naturskade og bremser målet og alle enheder inden for {2} meter med {3}% i {4}.", " nature damage and slowing the target and all units within ", "L"},
    {"^Puts the caster in stealth mode, but slows its movement by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. Lasts until cancelled%.$", "Sætter udøveren i snigskjul-tilstand, men bremser dens bevægelse med {1}%. Varer indtil annulleret.", "Puts the caster in stealth mode, but slows its movement by ", "P"},
    {"^Puts the caster in stealth mode, but slows its movement to ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of normal%. Lasts until cancelled%.$", "Sætter udøveren i snigskjul, men bremser dens bevægelse til {1}% af normalt. Varer indtil annulleret.", "Puts the caster in stealth mode, but slows its movement to ", "P"},
    {"^Reduces all point%-blank, area effect spell damage taken by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% when the caster is not facing the Rogue%.$", "Reducerer al modtagen besværgelsesskade på nært hold og fra områdeeffekter med {1}%, når udøveren ikke vender mod Skurken.", "Reduces all point-blank, area effect spell damage taken by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the Energy cost of your Sap and Blind abilities by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer Energiomkostningen for dine Harpiks- og Blænd-evner med {1}%.", "Reduces the Energy cost of your Sap and Blind abilities by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the chance you will be critically hit by spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% while Lightning Shield or Water Shield are active%.$", "Reducerer chancen for, at du bliver ramt kritisk af besværgelser, med {1}%, mens Lynskjold eller Vandskjold er aktive.", "Reduces the chance you will be critically hit by spells by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the hit chance of Disorient effects against you by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer træfchanceen for Desorientering-effekter mod dig med {1}%.", "Reduces the hit chance of Disorient effects against you by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the movement speed of an enemy by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and reduces all physical and magical damage it deals by ([%d%.,%-]+)%. Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Reducerer en fjendes bevægelseshastighed med {1}%, og reducerer al fysisk og magisk skade, den forvolder, med {2}. Varer {3}.", "%, and reduces all physical and magical damage it deals by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the threat generated by your Destruction spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer trussel genereret af dine Ødelæggelse-besværgelser med {1}%.", "Reduces the threat generated by your Destruction spells by ", "R"},
    {"^Restores ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your health and mana per second%.  Mmmm%.%.%. fruitcake%.%.%.$", "Genopretter {1}% af dit helbred og din mana pr. sekund.  Mmmm... frugtkage...", "% of your health and mana per second.  Mmmm... fruitcake...", "R"},
    {"^Shield of Righteousness also increases your Block Value by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Retfærdighedens Skjold øger også din Blokværdi med {1}% i {2}.", "Shield of Righteousness also increases your Block Value by ", "S"},
    {"^Slashes out at a target, inflicting ([%d%.,%-]+)%% weapon damage as Shadow and reducing healing received by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Hugger ud mod et mål, påfører {1}% våbenskade som Skyggeskade og reducerer modtagne helbredelse med {2}% i {3}.", "% weapon damage as Shadow and reducing healing received by ", "S"},
    {"^Stealth to sneak around, but reduce your movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.  Can only be used when out of combat%.  Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Snigen for at liste rundt, men reducerer din bevægelseshastighed med {1}%.  Kan kun bruges uden for kamp.  Varer {2}.", "Stealth to sneak around, but reduce your movement speed by ", "S"},
    {"^Target takes ([%d%.,%-]+) Nature damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) seconds and ([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased Arcane, Fire, Frost, Nature, and Shadow damage%.$", "Målet modtager {1} Naturskade hver {2} og {3}% øget Arkan-, Ild-, Frost-, Natur- og Skyggeskade.", "% increased Arcane, Fire, Frost, Nature, and Shadow damage.", "T"},
    {"^While your pet is active, you and your pet will regenerate ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of total health every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%.$", "Mens dit kæledyr er aktivt, genopretter du og dit kæledyr {1}% af det samlede helbred hver {2} sek.", "While your pet is active, you and your pet will regenerate ", "W"},
    {"^You are not high enough level to use this feature yet%. The (.-) feature unlocks at level ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "Du er ikke høj nok niveau til at bruge dette element endnu. Elementet {1} låses op på niveau {2}.", "You are not high enough level to use this feature yet. The ", "Y"},
    {"^You have a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to gain ([%d%.,%-]+) Energy each time you deal periodic Nature or Bleed damage%.$", "Du har en {1}% chance for at opnå {2} Energi, hver gang du forvolder periodisk naturskade eller blødningsskade.", " Energy each time you deal periodic Nature or Bleed damage.", "Y"},
    {"^Your ranged critical strikes increase your Attack Power by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Dine kritiske distanceangreb øger din Angrebskraft med {1}% i {2}.", "Your ranged critical strikes increase your Attack Power by ", "Y"},
    {"^%[(.-) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Adjust the relative frequency of party health callouts$", "[{1} - {2}] - Juster den relative hyppighed af gruppens helbredsudråb", "] - Adjust the relative frequency of party health callouts", "["},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance on successful spellcast to allow ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your Mana regeneration to continue while casting for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "{1}% chance ved vellykket besværgelsesstøbning for at lade {2}% af din Managenoprettelse fortsætte under støbning i {3}.", "% of your Mana regeneration to continue while casting for ", ""},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance successful spellcast to allow ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your Mana regeneration to continue while casting for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "{1}% chance for vellykket besværgelsesstøbning for at lade {2}% af din Managenoprettelse fortsætte under støbning i {3}.", "% of your Mana regeneration to continue while casting for ", ""},
    {"^2%% chance on successful spellcast to allow ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your Mana regeneration to continue while casting for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "2% chance ved vellykket besværgelsesstøbning for at lade {1}% af din mana-genoprettelse fortsætte under støbning i {2}.", "% of your Mana regeneration to continue while casting for ", "2"},
    {"^Aligns the Shaman with nature, increasing spell damage by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, improving heal effects by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and increasing mana cost of spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Justerer shamanen med naturen, øger besværgelsesskade med {1}%, forbedrer helbredelseseffekter med {2}% og øger besværgelsernes manaomkostning med {3}% i {4}.", "Aligns the Shaman with nature, increasing spell damage by ", "A"},
    {"^An aggressive stance%. Critical strike chance increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and all damage taken is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "En aggressiv holdning. Chancen for kritisk slag øges med {1}%, og al modtaget skade øges med {2}%.", "An aggressive stance. Critical strike chance increased by ", "A"},
    {"^Anara calls down stars at random player's locations every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. Each star inflicts ([%d%.,%-]+) Arcane damage to all players within ([%d%.,%-]+) yards of the impact%.$", "Anara kalder stjerner ned over tilfældige spilleres placeringer hvert {1} sek. i løbet af {2}. Hver stjerne påfører {3} Arkanskade til alle spillere inden for {4} meter fra nedslaget.", "Anara calls down stars at random player's locations every ", "A"},
    {"^Are you sure you wish to exchange (.-) for the following item%? Your purchase is not refundable%. (.-)$", "Er du sikker på, at du ønsker at bytte {1} til følgende genstand? Dit køb kan ikke refunderes. {2}", " for the following item? Your purchase is not refundable. ", "A"},
    {"^Chance to be critically struck by the caster increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Chanceen for at blive ramt kritisk af udøveren øges med {1}%.", "Chance to be critically struck by the caster increased by ", "C"},
    {"^Command your pet to Stun the target for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+) on its next successful attack, which also gains ([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased critical strike chance%. Generates high threat%.$", "Befal dit kæledyr at bedøve målet i {1} ved dets næste vellykkede angreb, som også får {2}% øget kritisk angrebschance. Genererer høj trussel.", "% increased critical strike chance. Generates high threat.", "C"},
    {"^Damage taken reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and damaging attacks will not cause spellcasting delays%.$", "Modtagen skade reduceret med {1}%, og skadelige angreb vil ikke forårsage forsinkelser i støbningen af besværgelser.", "% and damaging attacks will not cause spellcasting delays.", "D"},
    {"^Elune blesses Sylvestris, reducing all incoming damage by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Elunie velsigner Skovestris og reducerer al ankommende skade med {1}%.", "Elune blesses Sylvestris, reducing all incoming damage by ", "E"},
    {"^Has a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance when struck in combat of increasing all stats by ([%d%.,%-]+) for ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "Har en {1}% chance, når den rammes i kamp, for at øge alle egenskaber med {2} i {3}.", "% chance when struck in combat of increasing all stats by ", "H"},
    {"^Immobilizes the caster, but increases its attack speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Immobiliserer udøveren, men øger dens angrebshastighed med {1}% i {2}.", "Immobilizes the caster, but increases its attack speed by ", "I"},
    {"^Immune to Polymorph effects%.  Movement speed increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Immun over for Forvandling-effekter.  Bevægelseshastighed øget med {1}%.", "Immune to Polymorph effects.  Movement speed increased by ", "I"},
    {"^Improves your chance to hit with Frost and Fire spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Forbedrer din angrebschance ved Frost- og Ild-besværgelser med {1}%.", "Improves your chance to hit with Frost and Fire spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases run speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. While out of combat in Desert areas, gain an additional ([%d%.,%-]+)%% run speed and become invisible%.$", "Øger løbehastighed med {1}% i {2}. Når du er uden for kamp i ørkenområder, får du yderligere {3}% løbehastighed og bliver usynlig.", ". While out of combat in Desert areas, gain an additional ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Ranged Attack Power of party members within ([%d%.,%-]+) yards by ([%d%.,%-]+)%. Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger Distance Angrebskraft for gruppemedlemmer inden for {1} meter med {2}. Varer {3}.", "Increases the Ranged Attack Power of party members within ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the amount healed by your Healing Wave spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den mængde din Helbredelsesbølge-besværgelse helbreder med {1}%.", "Increases the amount healed by your Healing Wave spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the amount of damage absorbed by your shield by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger den mængde skade dit skjold absorberer med {1}% i {2}.", "Increases the amount of damage absorbed by your shield by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the amount of damage absorbed by your shield by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den mængde skade dit skjold absorberer med {1}%.", "Increases the amount of damage absorbed by your shield by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the amount of damage absorbed by your shield by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and gives your blocks a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to restore ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your maximum Mana%.  May only occur once every ([%d%.,%-]+)roccooldown sec%.$", "Øger den mængde skade dit skjold absorberer med {1}%, og giver dine blokeringer en {2}% chance for at genoprette {3}% af din maksimale Mana.  Kan kun ske én gang pr. {4} sek. nedkøling.", "Increases the amount of damage absorbed by your shield by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the attack speed of all nearby party members by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and attack damage by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%$", "Øger angrebshastigheden for alle nærliggende gruppemedlemmer med {1}% og angrebsskaden med {2}%$", "Increases the attack speed of all nearby party members by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the critical strike chance of Lightning Bolt by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den kritiske angrebschance for Lynbolt med {1}%.", "Increases the critical strike chance of Lightning Bolt by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage dealt by your Stormstrike ability by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden tilføjet af din Stormstød-evne med {1}%.", "Increases the damage dealt by your Stormstrike ability by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage done by your Divine Storm ability by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden forvoldt af din Guddommelig Storm-evne med {1}%.", "Increases the damage done by your Divine Storm ability by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage done by your Seals and Judgements by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden forvoldt af dine Segl og Domme med {1}%.", "Increases the damage done by your Seals and Judgements by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the frequency of Maelstrom Weapon triggering by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger hyppigheden af Malstrømsvåben-udløsning med {1}%.", "Increases the frequency of Maelstrom Weapon triggering by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the mana gained from your Mana Spring totems by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den mana, du opnår fra dine Mana-kildetotemer, med {1}%.", "Increases the mana gained from your Mana Spring totems by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your attack speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for your next 3 swings after you parry, dodge, or block%.$", "Øger din angrebshastighed med {1}% i dine næste 3 svinge, efter du parerer, undviger eller blokerer.", "% for your next 3 swings after you parry, dodge, or block.", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to Critical Hit with Frost Magic by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din chance for et kritisk angreb med Frostmagi med {1}%.", "Increases your chance to Critical Hit with Frost Magic by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to hit with your off%-hand weapon by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din træfchance med dit bivåben med {1}%.", "Increases your chance to hit with your off-hand weapon by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your critical strike chance with all attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din kritiske angrebschance med alle angreb med {1}%.", "Increases your critical strike chance with all attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your damage with One%-Handed Maces by ([%d%.,%-]+) and has a 1%% chance of stunning the target for 5 seconds%.$", "Øger din skade med Enhåndskøller med {1} og har en 1% chance for at bedøve målet i 5 sekunder.", " and has a 1% chance of stunning the target for 5 seconds.", "I"},
    {"^Increases your damage with One%-Handed Maces by ([%d%.,%-]+) and has a 1%% chance of stunning the target for 8 seconds%.$", "Øger din skade med Enhåndskøller med {1} og har en 1% chance for at bedøve målet i 8 sekunder.", " and has a 1% chance of stunning the target for 8 seconds.", "I"},
    {"^Inflicts normal damage plus ([%d%.,%-]+) to an enemy and its nearest allies, affecting up to ([%d%.,%-]+) targets and increasing the time between their attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Påfører normal skade plus {1} til en fjende og dens nærmeste allierede, rammer op til {2} mål og øger tiden mellem deres angreb med {3}% i {4}.", " targets and increasing the time between their attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Movement speed reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.\n\n([%d%.,%-]+) nature damage inflicted to self and nearby players every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%.\n\nCan be washed off%.$", "Bevægelseshastighed reduceret med {1}%.\n\n{2} naturskade påført dig selv og nærliggende spillere hver {3} sek.\n\nKan skylles af.", " nature damage inflicted to self and nearby players every ", "M"},
    {"^Quickens the mind, increasing the Mage's casting speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Skærper sindet og øger Magikerens støbningshastighed med {1}% i {2}.", "Quickens the mind, increasing the Mage's casting speed by ", "Q"},
    {"^Reduces the Mana cost of your next Revive Pet cast within (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+) by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer manaomkostningen for din næste Genoplive kæledyr-besværgelse inden for {1} med {2}%.", "Reduces the Mana cost of your next Revive Pet cast within ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the threat generated by your next damage spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer trussel genereret af din næste skadebesværgelse med {1}%.", "Reduces the threat generated by your next damage spell by ", "R"},
    {"^Reflects ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of harmful spells from the caster and nearby allies for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Reflekterer {1}% af skadelige besværgelser fra udøveren og nærliggende allierede i {2}.", "% of harmful spells from the caster and nearby allies for ", "R"},
    {"^Stuns an enemy and reduces its movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, in addition to increasing the caster's melee damage by ([%d%.,%-]+)%. Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Bedøver en fjende og reducerer dens bevægelseshastighed med {1}%, ud over at øge udøverens nærkampsskade med {2}. Varer {3}.", "%, in addition to increasing the caster's melee damage by ", "S"},
    {"^Suffer ([%d%.,%-]+)%% maximum health as Arcane damage and lose ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your maximum mana from walking through unstable mana%.$", "Lider {1}% af maksimalt liv som Arkanskade og taber {2}% af din maksimale mana ved at gå gennem ustabil mana.", "% of your maximum mana from walking through unstable mana.", "S"},
    {"^Unleash a cloud of lethargy in a ([%d%.,%-]+) yard radius%. Enemies that attack within the cloud have a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to succumb to sleep for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.  Lasts for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Udløs en sky af døsighed i en radius på {1} alen. Fjender, der angriber inden for skyen, har en chance på {2}% for at falde i søvn i {3}. Varer i {4}.", " yard radius. Enemies that attack within the cloud have a ", "U"},
    {"^You gain ([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased damage and critical damage done to Undead for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+) per Combo Point you spend, stacking up to ([%d%.,%-]+) times%.$", "Du opnår {1}% øget skade og kritisk skade forvoldt til Udøde i {2} pr. Kombinationspoint du bruger, ophobes op til {3} gange.", "% increased damage and critical damage done to Undead for ", "Y"},
    {"^Your Devotion Aura also reduces all spell damage taken by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Din Hengivenhedsaura reducerer også al besværgelsesskade du modtager med {1}%.", "Your Devotion Aura also reduces all spell damage taken by ", "Y"},
    {"^Your Ignite damage does not decay on Undead targets below ([%d%.,%-]+)%% health, and Undead targets below ([%d%.,%-]+)%% health take damage as if they were Frozen%.$", "Din Tænd-skade henfalder ikke på udøde mål under {1}% liv, og udøde mål under {2}% liv tager skade, som om de var Frossen.", "Your Ignite damage does not decay on Undead targets below ", "Y"},
    {"^Your melee critical strikes increase your attack speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Dine kritiske nærkampsangreb øger din angrebshastighed med {1}% i {2}.", "Your melee critical strikes increase your attack speed by ", "Y"},
    {"^Breathes molten lava at the target, instantly dealing ([%d%.,%-]+) Fire damage and reducing the target's casting speed by %$([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Spyr smeltet lava mod målet, forvolder øjeblikkeligt {1} Ildskade og reducerer målets støbningshastighed med ${2}% i {3}.", " Fire damage and reducing the target's casting speed by $", "B"},
    {"^Casting your Healing Touch or Nourish spells gives you a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to gain Mana equal to ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of the base cost of the spell%.$", "Når du støber dine Helbredende Berøring- eller Nærende-besværgelser, får du {1}% chance for at vinde mana svarende til {2}% af besværgelsens grundomkostning.", "Casting your Healing Touch or Nourish spells gives you a ", "C"},
    {"^Critical chance with all spells and attacks increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% until you deal a non%-periodic critical effect%.$", "Kritisk chance for alle besværgelser og angreb øget med {1}%, indtil du forvolder en ikke-periodisk kritisk effekt.", "Critical chance with all spells and attacks increased by ", "C"},
    {"^Increases damage dealt by Balefire Bolt and Pyroblast by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% but decreases Spirit by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. Reaching 0 Spirit is fatal%.$", "Øger skade tilføjet af Dødsildsbolt og Ildstød med {1}%, men reducerer Ånd med {2}%. At nå 0 Ånd er dødbringende.", "Increases damage dealt by Balefire Bolt and Pyroblast by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Physical damage taken by nearby enemies by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger den fysiske skade nærliggende fjender modtager med {1}% i {2}.", "Increases the Physical damage taken by nearby enemies by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage dealt by your Cone of Cold spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden tilføjet af din Kegle af Kold-besværgelse med {1}%.", "Increases the damage dealt by your Cone of Cold spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the duration of your Slice and Dice ability by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger varigheden af din Skive og Terninger-evne med {1}%.", "Increases the duration of your Slice and Dice ability by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the effect of your Blessing of Wisdom spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger effekten af din Visdommens Velsignelse-besværgelse med {1}%.", "Increases the effect of your Blessing of Wisdom spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the time between an enemy's attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and its movement by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. Lag also results in link death, stunning the enemy for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger tiden mellem en fjendes angreb med {1}% og dens bevægelse med {2}% i {3}. Forsinkelse medfører også forbindelsesdød, hvilket bedøver fjenden i {4}.", ". Lag also results in link death, stunning the enemy for ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to Critical Hit with Fire Magic by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din chance for et kritisk angreb med Ildmagi med {1}%.", "Increases your chance to Critical Hit with Fire Magic by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your critical strike chance with spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and increases damage done by your Fire spells by up to ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "Øger din kritiske angrebschance med besværgelser med {1}% og øger skaden forvoldt af dine Ild-besværgelser med op til {2}.", "% and increases damage done by your Fire spells by up to ", "I"},
    {"^Inflicts ([%d%.,%-]+) damage and reduces the enemy target's movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Påfører {1} skade og reducerer fjendens bevægelseshastighed med {2}% i {3}.", " damage and reduces the enemy target's movement speed by ", "I"},
    {"^Pummels nearby enemies for normal damage plus ([%d%.,%-]+) and interrupts any spell being cast 75%% of the time for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Tæver nærliggende fjender for normal skade plus {1} og afbryder enhver besværgelse, der besværges, 75% af tiden i {2}.", " and interrupts any spell being cast 75% of the time for ", "P"},
    {"^Puts your pet in stealth mode, but slows its movement to ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of normal%. The first attack from stealth receives a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% bonus to damage%.  Lasts until cancelled%.$", "Sætter dit kæledyr i snigskjul, men bremser dets bevægelse til {1}% af normalt. Det første angreb fra snigskjul får en {2}% bonus til skade.  Varer indtil annulleret.", "Puts your pet in stealth mode, but slows its movement to ", "P"},
    {"^Reduces the cast time your next Chain Lightning spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and increases its damage by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer besværgelsestiden for din næste Kædelyn-besværgelse med {1}%, og øger dens skade med {2}%.", "Reduces the cast time your next Chain Lightning spell by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the casting time of your Healing Touch spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and reduces the mana cost of your healing spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Reducerer støbetiden for dine Helbredende Berøring-besværgelser med {1}%, og reducerer manaomkostningen for dine helbredelsesbesværgelser med {2}% i {3}.", "Reduces the casting time of your Healing Touch spells by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the hit chance of Silence effects against you by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer træfchanceen for Tavshed-effekter mod dig med {1}%.", "Reduces the hit chance of Silence effects against you by ", "R"},
    {"^Remaining in Cat Form for ([%d%.,%-]+) seconds, causes your Energy Regeneration to increase by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Resterende i Katteform i {1} sekunder, øger din energiregeneration med {2}%.", " seconds, causes your Energy Regeneration to increase by ", "R"},
    {"^Removing the Profane Totem's damage immunity and dealing ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of its maximum health every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%.$", "Fjerner Profan Totemens skadesimmunitet og forvolder {1}% af dens maksimale helbred hvert {2} sek.", "Removing the Profane Totem's damage immunity and dealing ", "R"},
    {"^Summons a Fire Elemental to aid the caster in battle for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Fremkalder en Ildelementar, der hjælper udøveren i slag i {1}.", "Summons a Fire Elemental to aid the caster in battle for ", "S"},
    {"^Summons a Ward of Laze that lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. and curses nearby enemies every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%., temporarily reducing their attack speed by %$3826%%%.$", "Fremkalder et Dovenskabsværn, der varer {1}. og forbander nærliggende fjender hvert {2} sek., og midlertidigt reducerer deres angrebshastighed med $3826%.", " sec., temporarily reducing their attack speed by $3826%.", "S"},
    {"^Summons forth a Fiery Assistant to assist the caster for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Fremkalder en Ildende Assistent, der hjælper udøveren i {1}.", "Summons forth a Fiery Assistant to assist the caster for ", "S"},
    {"^Teleport the target to the New Avalon Town Hall and deal ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of their maximum health as shadow damage%.$", "Teleporterer målet til Rådhallen i Nyt Avalon og forvolder {1}% af deres maksimale helbred som skyggeskade.", "Teleport the target to the New Avalon Town Hall and deal ", "T"},
    {"^The Argent Dawn have rallied, increasing total health by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, healing done by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and damage dealt by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Sølvdæmringen har samlet troppene og øger samlet liv med {1}%, heling forvoldt med {2}% og skade tilføjet med {3}%.", "The Argent Dawn have rallied, increasing total health by ", "T"},
    {"^The end of an epoch is nigh!\nMovement speed increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.\nDamage taken reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.\nHealth increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Slutningen på en epoke er nær!\nBevægelseshastighed øget med {1}%.\nModtaget skade reduceret med {2}%.\nLiv øget med {3}%.", "The end of an epoch is nigh!\nMovement speed increased by ", "T"},
    {"^Weakens the target enemy, reducing melee attack power by ([%d%.,%-]+) and reducing the effectiveness of any healing by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)$", "Svækker målfjenden, sænker nærkamps-angrebskraft med {1} og reducerer effekten af enhver heling med {2}%. Varer {3}", "Weakens the target enemy, reducing melee attack power by ", "W"},
    {"^Weakens the target enemy, reducing melee attack power by ([%d%.,%-]+) and reducing the effectiveness of any healing by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Svækker målfjenden, sænker nærkamps-angrebskraft med {1} og reducerer effekten af enhver heling med {2}%. Varer {3}.", "Weakens the target enemy, reducing melee attack power by ", "W"},
    {"^When activated, increases your Dodge and Parry chance by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Når den aktiveres, øger din undvigelses- og parerings-chance med {1}% i {2}.", "When activated, increases your Dodge and Parry chance by ", "W"},
    {"^You have died%. You must hand the mantle of leadership of (.-) to another%. Type the player's name below%.$", "Du er død. Du skal overdrage lederskabet af {1} til en anden. Skriv spillerens navn nedenfor.", "You have died. You must hand the mantle of leadership of ", "Y"},
    {"^Your Arcane Blast increases damage done by an additional ([%d%.,%-]+)%% per stack%.$", "Din Arkan Sprængning øger forvoldt skade med yderligere {1}% pr. stabel.", "Your Arcane Blast increases damage done by an additional ", "Y"},
    {"^%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Choose the wording to use to say your target's casts$", "[{1} - {2}] - Vælg ordlyden der bruges til at sige dit måls besværgelser", "] - Choose the wording to use to say your target's casts", "["},
    {"^%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Says your health when it crosses certain percentages$", "[{1} - {2}] - Siger dit helbred når det krydser bestemte procenter", "] - Says your health when it crosses certain percentages", "["},
    {"^%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Select what to say when your target casts an ability$", "[{1} - {2}] - Vælg hvad der skal siges når dit mål bruger en evne", "] - Select what to say when your target casts an ability", "["},
    {"^(.-) created%.  To disband, use /teamdisband %[2v2, 3v3, 5v5%]%.$", "{1} skabt.  For at opløse, brug /teamdisband [2v2, 3v3, 5v5].", " created.  To disband, use /teamdisband [2v2, 3v3, 5v5].", ""},
    {"^(.-) has been disqualified from ranked play in this bracket%.$", "{1} er blevet diskvalificeret fra rangeret spil i denne række.", " has been disqualified from ranked play in this bracket.", ""},
    {"^Are you sure%? You can only undelete one character every (.-)%.$", "Er du sikker? Du kan kun gendanne én karakter hver {1}.", "Are you sure? You can only undelete one character every ", "A"},
    {"^Assumes a Shadowform, increasing Shadow damage dealt by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and reducing melee damage taken by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. Shadowform lasts until cancelled%.$", "Antager en Skyggeform, øger tilføjet Skyggeskade med {1}% og reducerer modtaget nærkampsskade med {2}%. Skyggeform varer indtil den annulleres.", "Assumes a Shadowform, increasing Shadow damage dealt by ", "A"},
    {"^Attack speed increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.  Weapon attacks strike an additional nearby opponent%.$", "Angrebshastighed øget med {1}%.  Våbenangreb rammer en ekstra nærliggende modstander.", "%.  Weapon attacks strike an additional nearby opponent.", "A"},
    {"^Breathes molten lava at ([%d%.,%-]+) nearby enemies, instantly dealing ([%d%.,%-]+) Fire damage and reducing the target's casting speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Spyr smeltet lava mod {1} nærliggende fjender, forvolder øjeblikkeligt {2} Ildskade og reducerer målets støbningshastighed med {3}% i {4}.", " Fire damage and reducing the target's casting speed by ", "B"},
    {"^Breathes molten lava at the target, instantly dealing ([%d%.,%-]+) Fire damage and reducing the target's casting speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Spyr smeltet lava mod målet, forvolder øjeblikkeligt {1} Ildskade og reducerer målets støbningshastighed med {2}% i {3}.", " Fire damage and reducing the target's casting speed by ", "B"},
    {"^Causes the caster to automatically inflict ([%d%.,%-]+) Nature damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%. to nearby enemies%. The aura lasts until cancelled%.$", "Forårsager, at udøveren automatisk forvolder {1} Naturskade hvert {2} sek. til nærliggende fjender. Glorien varer, indtil den annulleres.", " sec. to nearby enemies. The aura lasts until cancelled.", "C"},
    {"^Increase attack speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.  You may be able to push this experiment further%.%.%.%.%.$", "Øg angrebshastigheden med {1}%.  Du kan måske skubbe dette eksperiment endnu længere.....", "%.  You may be able to push this experiment further.....", "I"},
    {"^Increases critical strike damage bonus of all spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger bonus til kritisk slagskade for alle besværgelser med {1}%.", "Increases critical strike damage bonus of all spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Bleed damage done by your Rend ability by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger blødningsskaden forvoldt af din Flænse-evne med {1}%.", "Increases the Bleed damage done by your Rend ability by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the block chance of your Holy Shield spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger blokeringschanceen for din Helligt Skjold-besværgelse med {1}%.", "Increases the block chance of your Holy Shield spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the bonus chance to Block from Holy Shield by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger bonuschanceen for at blokere fra Helligt Skjold med {1}%.", "Increases the bonus chance to Block from Holy Shield by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the chance to apply Poisons to your target by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and gives Poison applications a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to not consume a charge%.$", "Øger chancen for at påføre dit mål Gifte med {1}%, og giver Gift-påføringer en {2}% chance for ikke at forbruge en ladning.", "Increases the chance to apply Poisons to your target by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the chance to apply poisons to your target by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger chancen for at påføre dit mål gifte med {1}%.", "Increases the chance to apply poisons to your target by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage of Exorcism and Crusader Strike by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden fra Eksorcisme og Korsfarerslag med {1}%.", "Increases the damage of Exorcism and Crusader Strike by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage of Flame Shock and Molten Blast by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden fra Flammechok og Smeltende Sprængning med {1}%.", "Increases the damage of Flame Shock and Molten Blast by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage of your Shadow Word: Pain spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden fra din Skyggeord: Smerte-besværgelse med {1}%.", "Increases the damage of your Shadow Word: Pain spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the effectiveness of your Chain Heal spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger effektiviteten af din Kædehelbred-besværgelse med {1}%.", "Increases the effectiveness of your Chain Heal spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the magical damage taken by nearby enemies by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger den magiske skade, nærliggende fjender tager, med {1}% i {2}.", "Increases the magical damage taken by nearby enemies by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the range of your offensive Balance spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and improves your chance to hit by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger rækkevidden for dine offensive Balance-besværgelser med {1}% og forbedrer din chance for at træffe med {2}%.", "Increases the range of your offensive Balance spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to block attacks with a shield by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and increases the amount blocked by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din chance for at blokere angreb med et skjold med {1}%, og øger mængden der blokeres med {2}%.", "Increases your chance to block attacks with a shield by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to block attacks with a shield by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din chance for at blokere angreb med et skjold med {1}%.", "Increases your chance to block attacks with a shield by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to get a critical with Daggers by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din chance for at få et kritisk angreb med Dolke med {1}%.", "Increases your chance to get a critical with Daggers by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to get a critical with a spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din chance for at få et kritisk angreb med en besværgelse med {1}%.", "Increases your chance to get a critical with a spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to hit with spells and attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din træfchance med besværgelser og angreb med {1}%.", "Increases your chance to hit with spells and attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your damage with Staves by ([%d%.,%-]+) and gives a 2%% chance to stun the target for 5 seconds%.$", "Øger din skade med Stave med {1} og giver en 2% chance for at bedøve målet i 5 sekunder.", " and gives a 2% chance to stun the target for 5 seconds.", "I"},
    {"^Increases your damage with Staves by ([%d%.,%-]+) and gives a 2%% chance to stun the target for 8 seconds%.$", "Øger din skade med Stave med {1} og giver en 2% chance for at bedøve målet i 8 sekunder.", " and gives a 2% chance to stun the target for 8 seconds.", "I"},
    {"^Increases your spellcasting, melee, and ranged Haste by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din støbnings-, nærkamps- og distancehastighed med {1}%.", "Increases your spellcasting, melee, and ranged Haste by ", "I"},
    {"^Level and skills are restricted to dungeon's max level %((.-)%)%.$", "Niveau og færdigheder er begrænset til fangehullets maksimale niveau ({1}).", "Level and skills are restricted to dungeon's max level (", "L"},
    {"^Reduces all damage taken from players and their pets by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. This effect cannot be combined from multiple sources%.$", "Reducerer al modtagen skade fra spillere og deres kæledyr med {1}%. Denne effekt kan ikke kombineres fra flere kilder.", "Reduces all damage taken from players and their pets by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces casting or channeling time lost when damaged by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and attacks heal the shielded target for ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "Reducerer den støbe- eller kanaliseringstid, der tabes ved skade, med {1}%, og angreb helbreder det skjoldede mål med {2}.", "Reduces casting or channeling time lost when damaged by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces chance to be critically hit and damage taken by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer chancen for at blive ramt kritisk og den modtagne skade med {1}%.", "Reduces chance to be critically hit and damage taken by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the casting time of your Greater Heal spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and reduces the mana cost of your healing spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Reducerer støbetiden for dine Større Helbred-besværgelser med {1}%, og reducerer manaomkostningen for dine helbredelsesbesværgelser med {2}% i {3}.", "Reduces the casting time of your Greater Heal spells by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the casting time of your next Immolate spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer støbetiden for din næste Antænd-besværgelse med {1}%.", "Reduces the casting time of your next Immolate spell by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the mana cost of your Frost spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and reduces the threat caused by your Frost spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer manaomkostningen for dine Frost-besværgelser med {1}%, og reducerer trussel forårsaget af dine Frost-besværgelser med {2}%.", "% and reduces the threat caused by your Frost spells by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces your speed penalty from your Stealth ability by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and reduces its cooldown by %$/1000;s2 sec%.$", "Reducerer din hastighedsstraf fra din Snigen-evne med {1}%, og reducerer dens genopladning med $/1000;s2 sek.", "Reduces your speed penalty from your Stealth ability by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces your target's resistance to all your spells by ([%d%.,%-]+) and reduces the threat caused by your Arcane spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer dit måls modstand mod alle dine besværgelser med {1}, og reducerer trussel forårsaget af dine Arkan-besværgelser med {2}%.", " and reduces the threat caused by your Arcane spells by ", "R"},
    {"^Regenerating ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your normal Mana regeneration while casting spells%.$", "Genererer {1}% af din normale manaregeneration, mens du støber besværgelser.", "% of your normal Mana regeneration while casting spells.", "R"},
    {"^Sunder Armor also deals ([%d%.,%-]+)%% weapon damage, increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% per application of Sunder Armor already on the target%.$", "Rustningssplitning forvolder også {1}% våbenskade, øget med {2}% pr. påføring af Rustningssplitning, der allerede er på målet.", "% per application of Sunder Armor already on the target.", "S"},
    {"^The world is scheduled to be available in approximately ([%d%.,%-]+) hours%.$", "Verden forventes at være tilgængelig om cirka {1} timer.", "The world is scheduled to be available in approximately ", "T"},
    {"^Turns the Shaman into a Ghost Wolf, increasing speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and decreasing all damage taken by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Forvandler Shamanen til en Spøgelsesulv, øger hastigheden med {1}% og formindsker al modtaget skade med {2}%.", "Turns the Shaman into a Ghost Wolf, increasing speed by ", "T"},
    {"^Turns the Shaman into a Ghost Wolf, increasing speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.  Only useable outdoors%.$", "Forvandler Shamanen til en Spøgelsesulv, øger hastigheden med {1}%.  Kan kun bruges udendørs.", "Turns the Shaman into a Ghost Wolf, increasing speed by ", "T"},
    {"^Viciously bites enemy appendages for ([%d%.,%-]+) damage and reduces the effectiveness of any healing by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Bider brutalt i fjendens lemmer for {1} skade og reducerer effekten af enhver heling med {2}% i {3}.", " damage and reduces the effectiveness of any healing by ", "V"},
    {"^Wounds the target for ([%d%.,%-]+) damage and increases the casting time of all spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Sårer målet for {1} skade og øger støbetiden for alle besværgelser med {2}% i {3}.", " damage and increases the casting time of all spells by ", "W"},
    {"^You can ignore collision when placing items by pressing (.-)$", "Du kan ignorere kollision, når du placerer genstande, ved at trykke på {1}", "You can ignore collision when placing items by pressing ", "Y"},
    {"^You can learn a sub%-specialization upon specializing in (.-)%.$", "Du kan lære en underspecialisering, når du specialiserer dig i {1}.", "You can learn a sub-specialization upon specializing in ", "Y"},
    {"^You have been playing for (.-)%. Excessive gameplay can interfere with your daily life%.$", "Du har spillet i {1}. Overdrevent spil kan forstyrre dit daglige liv.", ". Excessive gameplay can interfere with your daily life.", "Y"},
    {"^You killed another player! \nMovement speed increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Du dræbte en anden spiller! \nBevægelseshastighed øget med {1}% i {2}.", "You killed another player! \nMovement speed increased by ", "Y"},
    {"^Your guild transferred to (.-) %- (.-)%. To follow them you must initiate a character transfer%.$", "Din klan er flyttet til {1} - {2}. For at følge dem skal du starte en karakteroverførsel.", ". To follow them you must initiate a character transfer.", "Y"},
    {"^Your guild transferred to (.-)%. To follow them you must initiate a character transfer%.$", "Din klan er flyttet til {1}. For at følge dem skal du starte en karakteroverførsel.", ". To follow them you must initiate a character transfer.", "Y"},
    {"^Your rested experience accumulates ([%d%.,%-]+)%% faster and your rested experience cap is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Din hvilende erfaring samler sig {1}% hurtigere, og dit loft for hvilende erfaring øges med {2}%.", "% faster and your rested experience cap is increased by ", "Y"},
    {"^(.-) does not have the correct World of Warcraft expansion%.$", "{1} har ikke den rette udvidelse til Verden af Krigskunst.", " does not have the correct World of Warcraft expansion.", ""},
    {"^(.-) has started a scenario in (.-)%. Do you want to join them%?\n\nThis offer will expire in ([%d%.,%-]+) (.-)%.$", "{1} har startet et scenarie i {2}. Vil du slutte dig til dem?\n\nDette tilbud udløber om {3} {4}.", ". Do you want to join them?\n\nThis offer will expire in ", ""},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to reflect spells%.\nCannot move or cast spells%.$", "{1}% chance for at reflektere besværgelser.\nKan ikke bevæge sig eller støbe besværgelser.", "% chance to reflect spells.\nCannot move or cast spells.", ""},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+)%% increase to the total damage absorbed by Mana Shield%.$", "{1}% forøgelse af den samlede skade absorberet af Manaskjold.", "% increase to the total damage absorbed by Mana Shield.", ""},
    {"^Allies within ([%d%.,%-]+) yards of the Far Seer gain ([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased health and ([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased damage per Blade Master living in his army%.$", "Allierede inden for {1} meter fra Den Fjerne Seer får {2}% øget liv og {3}% øget skade pr. Klingemester, der lever i hans hær.", "% increased damage per Blade Master living in his army.", "A"},
    {"^Any unclaimed rewards will be lost after the launch of (.-)%.$", "Alle uhævdede belønninger går tabt efter lanceringen af {1}.", "Any unclaimed rewards will be lost after the launch of ", "A"},
    {"^Charmed%.\nDamage increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.\nSpells cast instantly%.\nAll resistances increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%.\nMovement speed increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Amuleret.\nSkade øges med {1}%.\nBesværgelser besværges øjeblikkeligt.\nAlle modstande øges med {2}.\nBevægelseshastigheden øges med {3}%.", "%.\nSpells cast instantly.\nAll resistances increased by ", "C"},
    {"^Dealing ([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased threat%. Health increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. Earth Shock Taunts targets to attack you%. ([%d%.,%-]+)%% reduced damage taken%. ([%d%.,%-]+)%% reduced chance to be critically hit by melee attacks%.$", "Forvolder {1}% øget trussel. Liv øget med {2}%. Jordchok provokerer mål til at angribe dig. {3}% reduceret modtaget skade. {4}% reduceret chance for at blive kritisk ramt af nærkampsangreb.", "% reduced chance to be critically hit by melee attacks.", "D"},
    {"^Each time you Block, your Block amount is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your Spell Damage for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+), stacking up to ([%d%.,%-]+) times%.$", "Hver gang du blokerer, øges din Blokværdi med {1}% af din Besværgelsesskade i {2}, og den kan ophobes op til {3} gange.", "Each time you Block, your Block amount is increased by ", "E"},
    {"^Forced into Berseker Stance%.\nIncreases damage taken by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Tvunget ind i Berserkerstilling.\nØger modtaget skade med {1}%.", "Forced into Berseker Stance.\nIncreases damage taken by ", "F"},
    {"^Heals from your Earth Shield have a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to make your next cast time heal instant cast%.$", "Helbredelser fra dit Jordskjold har en {1}% chance for at gøre din næste helbredelse med støbetid til en øjeblikkelig besværgelse.", "% chance to make your next cast time heal instant cast.", "H"},
    {"^In a Forest or Grassland area, restoring an additional ([%d%.,%-]+) Mana every 5 seconds%.$", "I et Skov- eller Græsmark-område genoprettes yderligere {1} Mana hver 5. sekund.", "In a Forest or Grassland area, restoring an additional ", "I"},
    {"^Increase the Slow effect and damage of Thunder Clap by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øg Langsomhed-effekten og skaden fra Torden Klap med {1}%.", "Increase the Slow effect and damage of Thunder Clap by ", "I"},
    {"^Increased all healing received by party members within ([%d%.,%-]+) yards by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øgede al modtagen heling for gruppemedlemmer inden for {1} meter med {2}%.", "Increased all healing received by party members within ", "I"},
    {"^Increases critical chance and spell critical chance by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger kritisk chance og besværgelsens kritiske chance med {1}%.", "Increases critical chance and spell critical chance by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases critical chance of all spells and attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and grants ([%d%.,%-]+) Attack Power%.$", "Øger kritisk chance for alle besværgelser og angreb med {1}% og giver {2} Angrebskraft.", "Increases critical chance of all spells and attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases critical chance of all spells and attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, increases Attack Power by ([%d%.,%-]+), and increases spell damage and healing by up to ([%d%.,%-]+)%. No effect while in a raid instance%.$", "Øger kritisk chance for alle besværgelser og angreb med {1}%, øger Angrebskraft med {2} og øger besværgelsesskade og heling med op til {3}. Ingen effekt i en razziainstans.", "Increases critical chance of all spells and attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases critical chance of all spells and attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, increases Attack Power by ([%d%.,%-]+), and increases spell damage and healing by up to ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "Øger kritisk chance for alle besværgelser og angreb med {1}%, øger Angrebskraft med {2} og øger besværgelsesskade og heling med op til {3}.", "Increases critical chance of all spells and attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Nature damage taken by nearby enemies by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and increases the Shadow damage they take by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger den Naturskade nærliggende fjender modtager med {1}% og øger den Skyggeskade, de modtager, med {2}%. Varer {3}.", "Increases the Nature damage taken by nearby enemies by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the initial damage of your Immolate spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den initiale skade fra din Antænd-besværgelse med {1}%.", "Increases the initial damage of your Immolate spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the range of your offensive Shadow spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger rækkevidden for dine offensive Skygge-besværgelser med {1}%.", "Increases the range of your offensive Shadow spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the threat generated by your Holy attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.  Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger den trussel, dine hellige angreb genererer, med {1}%.  Varer {2}.", "Increases the threat generated by your Holy attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the time between an enemy's attacks speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, slows its casting speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and slows its movement by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger tiden mellem en fjendes angreb med {1}%, bremser dens støbehastighed med {2}% og bremser dens bevægelse med {3}%. Varer {4}.", "Increases the time between an enemy's attacks speed by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to get a critical with Staves by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din chance for at få et kritisk angreb med Stave med {1}%.", "Increases your chance to get a critical with Staves by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your pet's chance to Dodge by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and decreases the time between your pet's attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger dit kæledyrs Undvigelseschance med {1}% og reducerer tiden mellem dit kæledyrs angreb med {2}%. Varer {3}.", "% and decreases the time between your pet's attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Perform a Propellerstorm, reducing your fall speed for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+) and dealing ([%d%.,%-]+)%% weapon damage to nearby enemies when you land%.$", "Udfør en Propellerstorm, der reducerer din faldhastighed i {1} og forvolder {2}% våbenskade til nærliggende fjender, når du lander.", "Perform a Propellerstorm, reducing your fall speed for ", "P"},
    {"^Reduces all damage your pet takes by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and increases the time between your pet's attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, but deals more damage with each attack%. Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Reducerer al skade dit kæledyr modtager med {1}% og øger tiden mellem dit kæledyrs angreb med {2}%, men forvolder mere skade med hvert angreb. Varer {3}.", "% and increases the time between your pet's attacks by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the hit chance of Bleed effects against you by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer træfchanceen for Bløde-effekter mod dig med {1}%.", "Reduces the hit chance of Bleed effects against you by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the hit chance of Charm effects against you by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer træfchanceen for Charme-effekter mod dig med {1}%.", "Reduces the hit chance of Charm effects against you by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the threat generated by your healing spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer trussel genereret af dine helbredelsesbesværgelser med {1}%.", "Reduces the threat generated by your healing spells by ", "R"},
    {"^Summons a Windfury Totem with ([%d%.,%-]+) health at the feet of the caster%.  The totem provides ([%d%.,%-]+)%% melee haste to all party and raid members within ([%d%.,%-]+) yards%.  Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Fremkalder en Vindraseri-totem med {1} helbred ved udøverens fødder.  Totemmet giver {2}% nærkampshastighed til alle gruppe- og razzia-medlemmer inden for {3} meter.  Varer {4}.", " health at the feet of the caster.  The totem provides ", "S"},
    {"^When struck in combat has a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance of causing the attacker to flee in terror for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. Can only occur once every ([%d%.,%-]+)roccooldown sec%.$", "Når den rammes i kamp, har den en {1}% chance for at få angriberen til at flygte i rædsel i {2}. Kan kun ske én gang hver {3}roccgenopladning sek.", "% chance of causing the attacker to flee in terror for ", "W"},
    {"^When struck in combat has a chance to energize you for ([%d%.,%-]+) mana%. This effect cannot occur more than once every ([%d%.,%-]+)roccooldown seconds%.$", "Når den rammes i kamp, har den en chance for at oplade dig med {1} mana. Denne effekt kan ikke ske oftere end én gang hver {2}roccgenopladning sekunder.", "When struck in combat has a chance to energize you for ", "W"},
    {"^Your Heroic Strike, Slam, and Overpower abilities deal ([%d%.,%-]+)%% more damage%.$", "Dit Heroisk Slag, Smæk og Overmagt forvolder {1}% mere skade.", "Your Heroic Strike, Slam, and Overpower abilities deal ", "Y"},
    {"^Your attacks against targets with Hunter's Mark have a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to activate your Mongoose Bite for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Dine angreb mod mål med Jægerens Mærke har {1}% chance for at aktivere din Mangustbid i {2}.", "Your attacks against targets with Hunter's Mark have a ", "Y"},
    {"^Your friend will be encouraged to join you by making a (.-) character on the Realm (.-)%.$", "Din ven vil blive opfordret til at slutte sig til dig ved at oprette et {1}-tegn på riget {2}.", "Your friend will be encouraged to join you by making a ", "Y"},
    {"^(.-) unlocked a guild bank tab with a Guild Vault Voucher%.$", "{1} oplåste en klanbank-fane med et Klan-hvælvgavekort.", " unlocked a guild bank tab with a Guild Vault Voucher.", ""},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased movement speed and mounted movement speed%.$", "{1}% øget bevægelseshastighed og monteret bevægelseshastighed.", "% increased movement speed and mounted movement speed.", ""},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased movement speed%.  Dazed if damage is taken%.$", "{1}% øget bevægelseshastighed.  Omtåget hvis der modtages skade.", "% increased movement speed.  Dazed if damage is taken.", ""},
    {"^A passive ability that grants a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to reflect spells while a shield is equipped%.$", "En passiv evne der giver {1}% chance for at reflektere besværgelser mens et skjold er udstyret.", "% chance to reflect spells while a shield is equipped.", "A"},
    {"^Allows ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your Health regeneration to work while in combat%.$", "Lader {1}% af din livsregeneration virke under kamp.", "% of your Health regeneration to work while in combat.", "A"},
    {"^Allows ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your Mana regeneration to continue while casting%.$", "Lader {1}% af din manaregeneration fortsætte under støbning.", "% of your Mana regeneration to continue while casting.", "A"},
    {"^Assault the target's mind with Shadow energy, causing ([%d%.,%-]+) Shadow damage over (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)  and slowing their movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Angrib målets sind med skyggeenergi, hvilket forårsager {1} Skyggeskade i løbet af {2}  og bremser deres bevægelseshastighed med {3}%.", "Assault the target's mind with Shadow energy, causing ", "A"},
    {"^Attack all nearby enemies, dealing weapon damage plus ([%d%.,%-]+) every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+), and reducing your own movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Angriber alle nærliggende fjender og påfører våbenskade plus {1} hvert {2} sek. i {3}, og reducerer din egen bevægelseshastighed med {4}%.", "Attack all nearby enemies, dealing weapon damage plus ", "A"},
    {"^Blasts nearby enemies with ice, dealing ([%d%.,%-]+) damage, increasing the time between their attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Sprænger nærliggende fjender med is, påfører {1} skade, øger tiden mellem deres angreb med {2}% og bevægelseshastigheden med {3}%.", " damage, increasing the time between their attacks by ", "B"},
    {"^Combo Point generating abilities gain ([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased critical strike chance%.\nMangle hits up to ([%d%.,%-]+) targets and has no cooldown%.\nImmune to Fear effects%.$", "Evner, der genererer Kombinationspoint, får {1}% øget kritisk angrebschance.\nLemlæstelse rammer op til {2} mål og har ingen nedkøling.\nImmun over for Frygt-effekter.", "% increased critical strike chance.\nMangle hits up to ", "C"},
    {"^Complete ([%d%.,%-]+) dungeons on Mythic difficulty to improve your reward%.$", "Fuldfør {1} fangehuller på mytisk sværhedsgrad for at forbedre din belønning.", " dungeons on Mythic difficulty to improve your reward.", "C"},
    {"^Deal ([%d%.,%-]+) Fire damage to your current target and an additional ([%d%.,%-]+) damage over (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. Deals ([%d%.,%-]+) times as much damage to Beast and Serpentine targets%.$", "Forvolder {1} Ildskade til dit nuværende mål og en ekstra {2} skade i løbet af {3}. Forvolder {4} gange så meget skade til Udyr- og Slangeagtige mål.", " Fire damage to your current target and an additional ", "D"},
    {"^Deals ([%d%.,%-]+) Fire damage over (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+) to target Demon or Beast and Roots them in place for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.  Damage caused may interrupt the effect%.$", "Forvolder {1} Ildskade i løbet af {2} til mål af typen Dæmon eller Udyr og Rodfæster dem på stedet i {3}.  Forårsaget skade kan afbryde effekten.", " to target Demon or Beast and Roots them in place for ", "D"},
    {"^Decreases the threat generated by your Fire spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Mindsker den trussel, dine Ildbesværgelser genererer, med {1}%.", "Decreases the threat generated by your Fire spells by ", "D"},
    {"^Each time you hit a target with Conflagrate, you gain ([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased Fire damage for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+), stacking up to ([%d%.,%-]+) times%.$", "Hver gang du rammer et mål med Opflamm, får du {1}% øget Ildskade i {2}, og den kan ophobes op til {3} gange.", "Each time you hit a target with Conflagrate, you gain ", "E"},
    {"^Empowered by the night%. Shadow damage is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Styrket af natten. Skyggeskade øges med {1}%.", "Empowered by the night. Shadow damage is increased by ", "E"},
    {"^Gain ([%d%.,%-]+) Agility for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. If there is an elemental nearby, gain an additional ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "Få {1} Smidighed i {2}. Hvis der er en elementar i nærheden, får du yderligere {3}.", ". If there is an elemental nearby, gain an additional ", "G"},
    {"^Immune to Polymorph effects%.  Increases swim speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and allows underwater breathing%.$", "Immun over for Forvandling-effekter.  Øger svømmehastigheden med {1}% og tillader undervandsånding.", "Immune to Polymorph effects.  Increases swim speed by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Armor bonus of your Inner Fire spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and increases its total charges by ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "Øger rustningsbonussen fra din Indre Ild-besværgelse med {1}% og øger dens samlede ladninger med {2}.", "Increases the Armor bonus of your Inner Fire spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Focus regeneration of your Beast pet by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger fokusgenoprettelsen for dit Udyr-kæledyr med {1}%.", "Increases the Focus regeneration of your Beast pet by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Focus regeneration of your pets by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and allows ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your Mana regeneration to continue while casting%.$", "Øger fokusgenoprettelsen for dine kæledyr med {1}% og gør, at {2}% af din managenoprettelse fortsætter under støbning.", "% of your Mana regeneration to continue while casting.", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Physical damage dealt by the chicken by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and speeds the chicken's attack by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger den fysiske skade forvoldt af kyllingen med {1}% og fremskynder kyllingens angreb med {2}% i {3}.", "Increases the Physical damage dealt by the chicken by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the critical strike chance of Holy Shock by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den kritiske angrebschance for Hellig Chok med {1}%.", "Increases the critical strike chance of Holy Shock by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage caused by your Ferocious Bite by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden forvoldt af dit Voldsomt Bid med {1}%.", "Increases the damage caused by your Ferocious Bite by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage done by your Retribution Aura by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden forvoldt af din Gengældelsesaura med {1}%.", "Increases the damage done by your Retribution Aura by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the effectiveness of your healing spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger effektiviteten af dine helbredelsesbesværgelser med {1}%.", "Increases the effectiveness of your healing spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the initial healing of Regrowth by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% when cast on a target affected by your Rejuvenation%.$", "Øger den initiale helbredelse fra Genvækst med {1}%, når den støbes på et mål, der er påvirket af din Foryngelse.", "% when cast on a target affected by your Rejuvenation.", "I"},
    {"^Increases the threat generated by your Holy spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den trussel, dine hellige besværgelser genererer, med {1}%.", "Increases the threat generated by your Holy spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the time between nearby enemies' attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and slows their movement and casting speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger tiden mellem nærliggende fjenders angreb med {1}% og bremser deres bevægelse og støbehastighed med {2}% i {3}.", "Increases the time between nearby enemies' attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the time between nearby enemies' attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and slows their movement by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger tiden mellem nærliggende fjenders angreb med {1}% og bremser deres bevægelse med {2}% i {3}.", "Increases the time between nearby enemies' attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the time between nearby enemies' attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger tiden mellem nærliggende fjenders angreb med {1}% i {2}.", "Increases the time between nearby enemies' attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the time between nearby enemies' attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, slows their movement by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and slow casting speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger tiden mellem nærliggende fjenders angreb med {1}%, bremser deres bevægelse med {2}% og bremser støbehastigheden med {3}% i {4}.", "Increases the time between nearby enemies' attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to get a critical with Wands by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din chance for at få et kritisk angreb med Tryllestave med {1}%.", "Increases your chance to get a critical with Wands by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your spell healing by up to ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your total Spirit and your spell damage by up to ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your total Spirit%.$", "Øger din besværgelsesheling med op til {1}% af din samlede Ånd og din besværgelsesskade med op til {2}% af din samlede Ånd.", "% of your total Spirit and your spell damage by up to ", "I"},
    {"^Movement slowed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. Your Mana,  Rage, and Energy generation is reduced%.$", "Bevægelse bremset med {1}%. Din Mana-, Vrede- og Energigenerering er reduceret.", "%. Your Mana,  Rage, and Energy generation is reduced.", "M"},
    {"^Reduces movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and increases Fire damage taken by all targets in a ([%d%.,%-]+) yard radius by ([%d%.,%-]+) for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Reducerer bevægelseshastigheden med {1}% og øger den Ildskade, alle mål inden for en radius af {2} alen modtager, med {3} i {4}.", "% and increases Fire damage taken by all targets in a ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces nearby enemies' chance to hit with attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Reducerer nærliggende fjenders chance for at ramme med angreb med {1}% i {2}.", "Reduces nearby enemies' chance to hit with attacks by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the Mana cost of your Healing Wave ability by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer manaomkostningen for din Helbredelsesbølge-evne med {1}%.", "Reduces the Mana cost of your Healing Wave ability by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the hit chance of Fear effects against you by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer træfchanceen for Frygt-effekter mod dig med {1}%.", "Reduces the hit chance of Fear effects against you by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the hit chance of Root effects against you by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer træfchanceen for Rod-effekter mod dig med {1}%.", "Reduces the hit chance of Root effects against you by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the hit chance of Stun effects against you by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer træfchanceen for Bedøvelse-effekter mod dig med {1}%.", "Reduces the hit chance of Stun effects against you by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the rate of an enemy's health regeneration by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, in addition to lowering its Strength by ([%d%.,%-]+) and its Agility by ([%d%.,%-]+), for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Reducerer en fjendes helbredsregenerationshastighed med {1}%, og sænker desuden dens Styrke med {2} og dens Smidighed med {3} i {4}.", "Reduces the rate of an enemy's health regeneration by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the threat generated by your Shadow spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer trussel genereret af dine Skygge-besværgelser med {1}%.", "Reduces the threat generated by your Shadow spells by ", "R"},
    {"^Resistance to all magic schools increased by ([%d%.,%-]+) and allows ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your mana regeneration to continue while casting%.$", "Modstand mod alle magiskoler øget med {1} og lader {2}% af din manaregeneration fortsætte, mens du støber.", "% of your mana regeneration to continue while casting.", "R"},
    {"^Shoots a bolt of ice, inflicting ([%d%.,%-]+) Frost damage to an enemy and slowing its movement by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Skyder et islyn, der påfører en fjende {1} Frostskade og bremser dens bevægelse med {2}% i {3}.", " Frost damage to an enemy and slowing its movement by ", "S"},
    {"^Sinister Strike Energy cost reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%.\nSinister Strike threat generated increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.\nSinister Strike and Eviscerate damage increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Energiomkostning for Uhyggeligt slag reduceret med {1}.\nTrussel genereret af Uhyggeligt slag øget med {2}%.\nSkade fra Uhyggeligt slag og Udtømning øget med {3}%.", "%.\nSinister Strike and Eviscerate damage increased by ", "S"},
    {"^Spirit Wolves' attacks heal them and their master for ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of damage done$", "Åndsulves angreb helbreder dem og deres herre for {1}% af forvoldt skade", "Spirit Wolves' attacks heal them and their master for ", "S"},
    {"^The battle has ended%. This battleground will close in (.-)$", "Slaget er slut. Denne slagmark lukker om {1}", "The battle has ended. This battleground will close in ", "T"},
    {"^The damage dealt by Creeping Darkness is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Skaden forvoldt af Krybende Mørke øges med {1}%.", "The damage dealt by Creeping Darkness is increased by ", "T"},
    {"^When struck by a non%-periodic damage spell you have a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance of getting a (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+) spell shield that absorbs ([%d%.,%-]+) of that school of damage%.$", "Når du rammes af en besværgelse uden periodisk skade, har du en {1}% chance for at få et {2}-besværgelsesskjold, der absorberer {3} af den skoles skade.", "When struck by a non-periodic damage spell you have a ", "W"},
    {"^When struck has a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance of reducing the attacker's movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for 5 secs%.$", "Når den rammes, har den en {1}% chance for at reducere angriberens bevægelseshastighed med {2}% i 5 sek.", "% chance of reducing the attacker's movement speed by ", "W"},
    {"^You don't own a building that uses the specialization (.-)%.$", "Du ejer ikke en bygning, der bruger specialiseringen {1}.", "You don't own a building that uses the specialization ", "Y"},
    {"^%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Choose the volume to use when saying your debuffs$", "[{1} - {2}] - Vælg lydstyrken der bruges når du siger dine svækkelser", "] - Choose the volume to use when saying your debuffs", "["},
    {"^%[DNT%] Suffer ([%d%.,%-]+)%% maximum health in damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%. Cannot kill the target%.\n\nThis is a debug spell%.$", "[OVERSÆT-IKKE] Lider {1}% af maksimalt liv i skade hvert {2} sek. Kan ikke dræbe målet.\n\nDette er en fejlretningsbesværgelse.", " sec. Cannot kill the target.\n\nThis is a debug spell.", "["},
    {"^(.-) cannot enter%. This instance is temporarily disabled%.$", "{1} kan ikke komme ind. Denne instans er midlertidigt deaktiveret.", " cannot enter. This instance is temporarily disabled.", ""},
    {"^(.-) has requested to join your group through Quick Join%.$", "{1} har bedt om at slutte sig til din gruppe via Hurtig Tilmelding.", " has requested to join your group through Quick Join.", ""},
    {"^(.-)'s attempt to share quest \"(.-)\" failed%. Your reputation is too high for that quest%.$", "{1}s forsøg på at dele opgaven \"{2}\" mislykkedes. Dit ry er for højt til den opgave.", "\" failed. Your reputation is too high for that quest.", ""},
    {"^(.-)'s friend (.-) has requested to join your group through Quick Join%.$", "{1}s ven {2} har bedt om at blive medlem af din gruppe via Hurtig Tilmelding.", " has requested to join your group through Quick Join.", ""},
    {"^(.-)'s guildmate (.-) has requested to join your group through Quick Join%.$", "{1}s klanbror {2} har bedt om at blive medlem af din gruppe via Hurtig Tilmelding.", " has requested to join your group through Quick Join.", ""},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+) damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) seconds, and increasing the time between attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "{1} skade hvert {2} sek., og øger tiden mellem angreb med {3}%.", " seconds, and increasing the time between attacks by ", ""},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your Mana regeneration continuing while casting%.$", "{1}% af din Managenoprettelse fortsætter under støbning.", "% of your Mana regeneration continuing while casting.", ""},
    {"^Activating this specialization will cost (.-)%. Are you sure you want to learn this specialization%?$", "Aktivering af denne specialisering koster {1}. Er du sikker på, at du vil lære denne specialisering?", ". Are you sure you want to learn this specialization?", "A"},
    {"^Are you sure you want to replace this equipment with (.-)%?$", "Er du sikker på, at du vil erstatte dette udstyr med {1}?", "Are you sure you want to replace this equipment with ", "A"},
    {"^Are you sure you want to reroll all the abilities on (.-)%?$", "Er du sikker på, at du vil omrulle alle evnerne på {1}?", "Are you sure you want to reroll all the abilities on ", "A"},
    {"^Causes dark magic to flow around targets, inflicting ([%d%.,%-]+) Shadow damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec and reducing damage done by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Får mørk magi til at strømme rundt om mål, påfører {1} Skyggeskade hver {2} sek. og reducerer forvoldt skade med {3}% i {4}.", "Causes dark magic to flow around targets, inflicting ", "C"},
    {"^Damage done by you or your summoned demon has a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to increase the damage done by the other by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Skade forvoldt af dig eller din fremkaldte dæmon har en {1}% chance for at øge skaden forvoldt af den anden med {2}% i {3}.", "% chance to increase the damage done by the other by ", "D"},
    {"^Damage from all spells but Arcane Blast increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and mana cost of Arcane Blast increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Skade fra alle besværgelser undtagen Arkan Sprængning øget med {1}%, og manaomkostningen for Arkan Sprængning øget med {2}%.", "Damage from all spells but Arcane Blast increased by ", "D"},
    {"^Debug launches a bolt of frost at the enemy, causing ([%d%.,%-]+) Frost damage and slowing movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Fejlsøgning affyrer et frostlyn mod fjenden, der forvolder {1} Frostskade og bremser bevægelseshastigheden med {2}% i {3}.", "Debug launches a bolt of frost at the enemy, causing ", "D"},
    {"^Empowered by the moon%. Arcane damage is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Styrket af månen. Arkanskade øges med {1}%.", "Empowered by the moon. Arcane damage is increased by ", "E"},
    {"^Fire, Frost, and Arcane damage taken is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Modtagen ild-, frost- og arkanskade øges med {1}%.", "Fire, Frost, and Arcane damage taken is increased by ", "F"},
    {"^Gilnean Sharks are attacking! Taking damage equal to ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your health every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Gilneanske Hajer angriber! Du tager skade svarende til {1}% af dit liv hvert {2} sek. i {3}.", "Gilnean Sharks are attacking! Taking damage equal to ", "G"},
    {"^Gives a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance of ignoring spell interruption when damaged%.$", "Giver en {1}% chance for at ignorere besværgelsesafbrydelse, når du tager skade.", "% chance of ignoring spell interruption when damaged.", "G"},
    {"^Increases the Physical damage dealt by the caster by ([%d%.,%-]+) and its movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger den fysiske skade forvoldt af udøveren med {1} og dens bevægelseshastighed med {2}% i {3}.", "Increases the Physical damage dealt by the caster by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Physical damage dealt by the caster by ([%d%.,%-]+) and speeds its attack by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger den fysiske skade forvoldt af udøveren med {1} og fremskynder dens angreb med {2}% i {3}.", "Increases the Physical damage dealt by the caster by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Physical damage dealt by the caster by ([%d%.,%-]+) and speeds its attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger den fysiske skade forvoldt af udøveren med {1} og fremskynder dens angreb med {2}% i {3}.", "Increases the Physical damage dealt by the caster by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Physical damage dealt by the caster by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and enhances its armor by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger den fysiske skade forvoldt af udøveren med {1}% og forstærker dens rustning med {2}% i {3}.", "Increases the Physical damage dealt by the caster by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage done by your off%-hand weapon by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden forvoldt af dit bivåben med {1}%.", "Increases the damage done by your off-hand weapon by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage of your Imp's Firebolt spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and the effect of its Fire Shield spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden fra din Dæmonlingens Ildbolt-besværgelse med {1}% og effekten af dens Ildskjold-besværgelse med {2}%.", "Increases the damage of your Imp's Firebolt spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage you deal with ranged weapons by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den skade, du forvolder med distancevåben, med {1}%.", "Increases the damage you deal with ranged weapons by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your damage dealt with off%-hand attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din forvoldte skade med bivåbenangreb med {1}%.", "Increases your damage dealt with off-hand attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Melee and ranged attacks against Orcs and Ogres deal ([%d%.,%-]+)%% additional damage as Physical damage%.$", "Nærkamps- og distanceangreb mod Orker og Oger forvolder {1}% ekstra skade som fysisk skade.", "Melee and ranged attacks against Orcs and Ogres deal ", "M"},
    {"^Shoots at an enemy, inflicting ([%d%.,%-]+) additional Frost damage and slowing its movement by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Skyder mod en fjende, påfører {1} ekstra Frostskade og bremser dens bevægelse med {2}% i {3}.", " additional Frost damage and slowing its movement by ", "S"},
    {"^Taking ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of all damage done by the Warlock to other targets%.$", "Modtager {1}% af al skade forvoldt af Hekseleder til andre mål.", "% of all damage done by the Warlock to other targets.", "T"},
    {"^The Catalyst is recharging and will be functional in (.-)$", "Katalysatoren genoplader og bliver funktionsdygtig om {1}", "The Catalyst is recharging and will be functional in ", "T"},
    {"^The battle for (.-) is about to begin! Would you like to join the queue%?$", "Slaget om {1} er ved at begynde! Vil du gerne slutte dig til køen?", " is about to begin! Would you like to join the queue?", "T"},
    {"^The spirit struggles to maintain its form, suffering ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of maximum health as damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%.$", "Ånden kæmper for at opretholde sin skikkelse og lider {1}% af maksimalt helbred som skade hver {2}.", "The spirit struggles to maintain its form, suffering ", "T"},
    {"^The target of your Spirit of the Alpha ability takes ([%d%.,%-]+)%% reduced damage from Undead enemies%.$", "Målet for din Alfaens Ånd-evne modtager {1}% reduceret skade fra udøde fjender.", "The target of your Spirit of the Alpha ability takes ", "T"},
    {"^Your party does not meet the minimum required level %((.-)%)%.$", "Din gruppe opfylder ikke det krævede minimumsniveau ({1}).", "Your party does not meet the minimum required level (", "Y"},
    {"^\n\nIn this condition, you can get\n([%d%.,%-]+) more monster experience\nbefore the next rest state%.$", "I denne tilstand kan du få\n{1} mere monstererfaring\nfør den næste hvilefase.", " more monster experience\nbefore the next rest state.", "\n"},
    {"^%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Choose a phrase to indicate your target has died$", "[{1} - {2}] - Vælg en frase der angiver at dit mål er død", "] - Choose a phrase to indicate your target has died", "["},
    {"^%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Choose the format to use when saying your debuff$", "[{1} - {2}] - Vælg formatet der bruges når du siger din svækkelse", "] - Choose the format to use when saying your debuff", "["},
    {"^%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Choose the format to use when saying your health$", "[{1} - {2}] - Vælg formatet der bruges når du siger dit helbred", "] - Choose the format to use when saying your health", "["},
    {"^%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Choose the voice to use when saying your debuffs$", "[{1} - {2}] - Vælg stemmen der bruges når du siger dine svækkelser", "] - Choose the voice to use when saying your debuffs", "["},
    {"^%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Choose the volume to use when saying your health$", "[{1} - {2}] - Vælg lydstyrken der bruges når du siger dit helbred", "] - Choose the volume to use when saying your health", "["},
    {"^(.-) has restricted calendar invites from other players%.$", "{1} har begrænset kalenderinvitationer fra andre spillere.", " has restricted calendar invites from other players.", ""},
    {"^(.-) is from a different realm and will not be summoned%.$", "{1} er fra et andet rige og vil ikke blive fremkaldt.", " is from a different realm and will not be summoned.", ""},
    {"^(.-) wants to resurrect you and will be able to in ([%d%.,%-]+) (.-)%.  You will be afflicted with resurrection sickness%.$", "{1} vil genoplive dig og vil kunne det om {2} {3}.  Du vil være ramt af genoplivningssyge.", ".  You will be afflicted with resurrection sickness.", ""},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+) Physical damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec until the victim is above 90%% health remaining%.$", "{1} Fysisk skade hver {2} sek., indtil offeret er over 90% resterende helbred.", " sec until the victim is above 90% health remaining.", ""},
    {"^Are you sure you want to upgrade this legendary for (.-)%?$", "Er du sikker på, at du vil opgradere denne legendariske for {1}?", "Are you sure you want to upgrade this legendary for ", "A"},
    {"^Chance to apply poisons to your target increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Chanceen for at påføre gift på dit mål øges med {1}%.", "Chance to apply poisons to your target increased by ", "C"},
    {"^Consuming Holy Power increases your Attack Power by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% per Holy Power consumed for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Forbrug af Hellig Kraft øger din Angrebskraft med {1}% pr. forbrugt Hellig Kraft i {2}.", "Consuming Holy Power increases your Attack Power by ", "C"},
    {"^Decreases the mana cost of Power Word: Fortitude by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and increases its duration by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Mindsker mana-omkostningen for Kraftord: Sejhed med {1}% og øger dens varighed med {2}%.", "Decreases the mana cost of Power Word: Fortitude by ", "D"},
    {"^Descend into madness, increasing attack speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% as well as increasing the threat you generate for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Stig ned i vanvid, øger angrebshastigheden med {1}% og øger den trussel, du genererer, i {2}.", "% as well as increasing the threat you generate for ", "D"},
    {"^Descend into madness, increasing spell damage by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% as well as increasing the threat you generate for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Stig ned i vanvid, øger besværgelsesskade med {1}% og øger den trussel, du genererer, i {2}.", "% as well as increasing the threat you generate for ", "D"},
    {"^Hacks at the current target reducing their armor by ([%d%.,%-]+) and dealing ([%d%.,%-]+) Physical damage%.  Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Hugger det nuværende mål, reducerer dets rustning med {1} og forvolder {2} fysisk skade.  Varer {3}.", "Hacks at the current target reducing their armor by ", "H"},
    {"^Heal the enemy for ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of their maximum health, however they will suffer ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of their maximum health every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec until they leave combat%.$", "Hel fjenden for {1}% af deres maksimale helbred, men de vil lide {2}% af deres maksimale helbred hvert {3} sek., indtil de forlader kampen.", "% of their maximum health, however they will suffer ", "H"},
    {"^Increases damage done by your Deep Wounds talent by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skade forvoldt af dit talent Dybe Sår med {1}%.", "Increases damage done by your Deep Wounds talent by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases health regeneration rates%.\n\nHealth Regen: ([%d%.,%-]+) per 5 sec%.\nCombat Health Regen: ([%d%.,%-]+) per 5 sec%.$", "Øger hastigheden for helbredsregeneration.\n\nLiv-genopretning: {1} pr. 5 sek.\nKamp-liv-genopretning: {2} pr. 5 sek.", "Increases health regeneration rates.\n\nHealth Regen: ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Frost damage dealt by Biting Chill by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger Frostskaden fra Bidende Kulde med {1}%.", "Increases the Frost damage dealt by Biting Chill by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage done by your pets and hawks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden forvoldt af dine kæledyr og falke med {1}%.", "Increases the damage done by your pets and hawks by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage of Ferocious Bite and Shred by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden fra Voldsomt Bid og Strimling med {1}%.", "Increases the damage of Ferocious Bite and Shred by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage you deal with melee weapons by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den skade, du forvolder med nærkampsvåben, med {1}%.", "Increases the damage you deal with melee weapons by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to critical with Crossbows by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din chance for at ramme kritisk med Armbrøster med {1}%.", "Increases your chance to critical with Crossbows by ", "I"},
    {"^Inflicts ([%d%.,%-]+) Nature damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec, transfering that much health to the Wild King%.$", "Påfører {1} naturskade hvert {2} sek. og overfører så meget liv til Den Vilde Konge.", " sec, transfering that much health to the Wild King.", "I"},
    {"^Inflicts numbing pain that deals ([%d%.,%-]+) Nature damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec and increases time between target's attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Påfører en bedøvende smerte, der forvolder {1} naturskade hvert {2} sek. og øger tiden mellem målets angreb med {3}% i {4}.", " sec and increases time between target's attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Instantly attack the target causing damage equal to ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your Attack Power plus ([%d%.,%-]+) and increasing your movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Angriber straks målet og forvolder skade svarende til {1}% af din Angrebskraft plus {2}, og øger din bevægelseshastighed med {3}% i {4}.", "Instantly attack the target causing damage equal to ", "I"},
    {"^Mana regeneration increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. \n\nAll damage taken and received and increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.\n\nHaste increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Manaregeneration øget med {1}%. \n\nAl modtagen og erhvervet skade øget med {2}%.\n\nHastighed øget med {3}%.", "%. \n\nAll damage taken and received and increased by ", "M"},
    {"^Normal mana regeneration activated and increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Normal managenoprettelse aktiveret og øget med {1}%.", "Normal mana regeneration activated and increased by ", "N"},
    {"^Overheating%. All damage taken increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% while radiating fire damage to all nearby enemies%.$", "Overophedning. Al modtagen skade øget med {1}%, mens der udstråles ildskade til alle nærliggende fjender.", "% while radiating fire damage to all nearby enemies.", "O"},
    {"^Protects the caster from all attacks and spells for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%., but also increases the time between attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% during that time%.$", "Beskytter udøveren mod alle angreb og besværgelser i {1}., men øger også tiden mellem angreb med {2}% i den tid.", "Protects the caster from all attacks and spells for ", "P"},
    {"^Raptor Strike and Mongoose Bite damage increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Rovfugleslag og Mangustbid skade øget med {1}%.", "Raptor Strike and Mongoose Bite damage increased by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the Mana cost of your Destruction spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer manaomkostningen for dine Ødelæggelse-besværgelser med {1}%.", "Reduces the Mana cost of your Destruction spells by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the Mana cost of your Holy Light ability by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer manaomkostningen for din Hellig Let-evne med {1}%.", "Reduces the Mana cost of your Holy Light ability by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the cast time of your Holy Wrath ability by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, reduces its cooldown by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and reduces its mana cost by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer besværgelsestiden for din Hellig Vrede-evne med {1}%, reducerer dens genopladning med {2}%, og reducerer dens manaomkostning med {3}%.", "Reduces the cast time of your Holy Wrath ability by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the gold price of items from all vendors by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer guldprisen på genstande fra alle købmænd med {1}%.", "Reduces the gold price of items from all vendors by ", "R"},
    {"^Slice the target's ankle, slowing movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Skiver målets ankel og bremser bevægelseshastigheden med {1}% i {2}.", "Slice the target's ankle, slowing movement speed by ", "S"},
    {"^Target takes ([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased damage from the caster's next Ice Lance%.$", "Målet modtager {1}% øget skade fra udøverens næste Islanse.", "% increased damage from the caster's next Ice Lance.", "T"},
    {"^Time between attacks increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.\nReduces movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.\nDrains %$/10;s3 rage per second%.\nGetting sleepy%.%.%.$", "Tid mellem angreb øget med {1}%.\nReducerer bevægelseshastighed med {2}%.\nDræner $/10;s3 raseri pr. sekund.\nBliver søvnig...", "%.\nDrains $/10;s3 rage per second.\nGetting sleepy...", "T"},
    {"^Unleash a screech, dealing ([%d%.,%-]+) Physical damage and Silencing affected targets for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Udløs et hvin, der påfører {1} Fysisk skade og tavsgør de ramte mål i {2}.", " Physical damage and Silencing affected targets for ", "U"},
    {"^When activated, this ability temporarily grants you ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your maximum health for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. After the effect expires, the health is lost%.$", "Når den aktiveres, giver denne evne dig midlertidigt {1}% af dit maksimale helbred i {2}. Når effekten udløber, går helbredet tabt.", "When activated, this ability temporarily grants you ", "W"},
    {"^When struck in combat has a 1%% chance of inflicting ([%d%.,%-]+) Frost damage to the attacker and freezing them for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Når den rammes i kamp, har den en 1% chance for at påføre angriberen {1} Frostskade og fryse dem fast i {2}.", "When struck in combat has a 1% chance of inflicting ", "W"},
    {"^You deal ([%d%.,%-]+)%% more damage while you have more than ([%d%.,%-]+)%% mana%. While below ([%d%.,%-]+)%% mana ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your mana regeneration continues while casting%.$", "Du påfører {1}% mere skade, mens du har mere end {2}% mana. Når du er under {3}% mana, fortsætter {4}% af din managenoprettelse, mens du støber.", "% of your mana regeneration continues while casting.", "Y"},
    {"^Your Reckoning talent now has a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance per talent point to trigger when you Block%.$", "Dit Opgør-talent har nu en {1}% chance pr. talentpoint for at udløses, når du blokerer.", "% chance per talent point to trigger when you Block.", "Y"},
    {"^Your Rolling with the Punches now grants ([%d%.,%-]+)%% more health and ([%d%.,%-]+)%% more damage per stack%. At ([%d%.,%-]+) stacks, each time you Dodge or Parry you will gain ([%d%.,%-]+) Energy%.$", "Dit Rullende Hug giver nu {1}% mere helbred og {2}% mere skade pr. stak. Ved {3} stakke vil du hver gang du Undviger eller Parerer få {4} Energi.", " stacks, each time you Dodge or Parry you will gain ", "Y"},
    {"^Your Well Fed buffs metabolize ([%d%.,%-]+)%% slower%. This effect is increased by an additional ([%d%.,%-]+)%% in Wasteland areas%.$", "Dine Velmæt-buffs omsættes {1}% langsommere. Denne effekt øges med yderligere {2}% i Ødemark-områder.", "% slower. This effect is increased by an additional ", "Y"},
    {"^Your next ([%d%.,%-]+) instances of Raptor Strike damage are increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.  Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Dine næste {1} Rovfugleslag-skader øges med {2}%.  Varer {3}.", " instances of Raptor Strike damage are increased by ", "Y"},
    {"^Your ranged criticals increase your attack power by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your Agility for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Dine kritiske distanceangreb øger din angrebskraft med {1}% af din Smidighed i {2}.", "Your ranged criticals increase your attack power by ", "Y"},
    {"^sound:%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] Choose a sound to indicate that combat has started$", "sound:[{1} - {2}] Vælg en lyd, der angiver, at kampen er begyndt", "] Choose a sound to indicate that combat has started", "s"},
    {"^%[(.-)%] You are not in the correct area for this channel%.$", "[{1}] Du er ikke i det rigtige område for denne kanal.", "] You are not in the correct area for this channel.", "["},
    {"^%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Choose the voice to use when saying your health$", "[{1} - {2}] - Vælg stemmen der bruges når du siger dit helbred", "] - Choose the voice to use when saying your health", "["},
    {"^%[PH%] Activating this row increases your stamina by (.-)%%%.$", "[PL] Aktivering af denne række øger din udholdenhed med {1}%.", "[PH] Activating this row increases your stamina by ", "["},
    {"^(.-) does not have the profession to craft this recipe%.$", "{1} har ikke erhvervet til at fremstille denne opskrift.", " does not have the profession to craft this recipe.", ""},
    {"^(.-) doesn't own the required expansion for that quest%.$", "{1} ejer ikke den nødvendige udvidelse til den opgave.", " doesn't own the required expansion for that quest.", ""},
    {"^(.-) set to Enabled%. For options, type /ttscombat help%.$", "{1} sat til Aktiveret. For indstillinger, skriv /ttskamp hjælp.", " set to Enabled. For options, type /ttscombat help.", ""},
    {"^An enchanted edge increases your chance to hit by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. This has no effect outside of Blackfathom Deeps%.$", "En fortryllet æg øger din træfchance med {1}%. Dette har ingen effekt uden for Den Sorte Afgrund.", "%. This has no effect outside of Blackfathom Deeps.", "A"},
    {"^Consuming Holy Power increases your Spell Power by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% per Holy Power consumed for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Forbrug af Hellig Kraft øger din Besværgelseskraft med {1}% pr. forbrugt Hellig Kraft i {2}.", "Consuming Holy Power increases your Spell Power by ", "C"},
    {"^Deals nature damage to enemies in an area over (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+), slowing their movement by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and increasing the time between their attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Forvolder naturskade til fjender i et område i løbet af {1}, bremser deres bevægelse med {2}% og øger tiden mellem deres angreb med {3}%.", "% and increasing the time between their attacks by ", "D"},
    {"^Destruction spell critical hit chance increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Chancen for kritisk træf med ødelæggelsesbesværgelser øget med {1}%.", "Destruction spell critical hit chance increased by ", "D"},
    {"^Encases an ally in a layer of frost that lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. The thick ice increases armor by ([%d%.,%-]+), slows melee attackers' movement to ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and increases the time between their attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Omslutter en allieret i et lag frost, der varer {1}. Det tykke is øger rustningen med {2}, bremser nærkampsangriberes bevægelse til {3}% og øger tiden mellem deres angreb med {4}%.", "%, and increases the time between their attacks by ", "E"},
    {"^Encases the caster in a layer of frost that lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. The thick ice increases armor by ([%d%.,%-]+), slows melee attackers' movement to ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and increases the time between their attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Omslutter udøveren i et lag frost, der varer {1}. Det tykke is øger rustningen med {2}, bremser nærkampsangriberes bevægelse til {3}% og øger tiden mellem deres angreb med {4}%.", "%, and increases the time between their attacks by ", "E"},
    {"^Equip: Decreases the Block Value of your shield by ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "Udstyr: Mindsker Blokværdien på dit skjold med {1}.", "Equip: Decreases the Block Value of your shield by ", "E"},
    {"^Equip: Increases the Block Value of your shield by ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "Udstyr: Øger dit skjolds Blokværdi med {1}.", "Equip: Increases the Block Value of your shield by ", "E"},
    {"^Increases all forms of damage taken by an enemy by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger al slags skade fjenden modtager med {1}% i {2}.", "Increases all forms of damage taken by an enemy by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases critical chance of spells and attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, increases Attack Power by ([%d%.,%-]+), and increases spell damage and healing by up to ([%d%.,%-]+)%. Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. No effect while in a raid instance%.$", "Øger kritisk chance for besværgelser og angreb med {1}%, øger Angrebskraft med {2} og øger besværgelsesskade og heling med op til {3}. Varer {4}. Ingen effekt i en razziainstans.", "Increases critical chance of spells and attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases critical chance of spells and attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, increases Attack Power by ([%d%.,%-]+), and increases spell damage and healing by up to ([%d%.,%-]+)%. Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger kritisk chance for besværgelser og angreb med {1}%, øger Angrebskraft med {2} og øger besværgelsesskade og heling med op til {3}. Varer {4}.", "Increases critical chance of spells and attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Physical damage taken by an enemy by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger den fysiske skade en fjende modtager med {1}% i {2}.", "Increases the Physical damage taken by an enemy by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the amount healed by your Renew spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den mængde din Fornyelse-besværgelse helbreder med {1}%.", "Increases the amount healed by your Renew spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the critical hit chance of Holy Shock by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den kritiske angrebschance for Hellig Chok med {1}%.", "Increases the critical hit chance of Holy Shock by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the critical hit chance of spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. If Shock and Awe is engraved, gain an additional ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den kritiske angrebschance for besværgelser med {1}% i {2}. Hvis Chok og Ærefrygt er indgraveret, får du en ekstra {3}%.", ". If Shock and Awe is engraved, gain an additional ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage  of your Judgement ability by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden for din Dom-evne med {1}%.", "Increases the damage  of your Judgement ability by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage done by your Bane of Agony by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden forvoldt af din Bane af Kval med {1}%.", "Increases the damage done by your Bane of Agony by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage done by your Ignite talent by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden forvoldt af dit Tænd-talent med {1}%.", "Increases the damage done by your Ignite talent by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage done by your Raptor Strike by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden forvoldt af dit Rovfugleslag med {1}%.", "Increases the damage done by your Raptor Strike by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage done by your Serpent Sting by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden forvoldt af dit Slangebrod med {1}%.", "Increases the damage done by your Serpent Sting by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage done by your next Starfire by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden forvoldt af din næste Stjerneild med {1}%.", "Increases the damage done by your next Starfire by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the effect of all your healing spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger effekten af alle dine helbredelsesbesværgelser med {1}%.", "Increases the effect of all your healing spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the effect of your Rejuvenation spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger effekten af din Foryngelse-besværgelse med {1}%.", "Increases the effect of your Rejuvenation spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your Block chance by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. This effect is doubled in Strongholds and Cities%.$", "Øger din blokchance med {1}% i {2}. Denne effekt fordobles i Fæstninger og Byer.", ". This effect is doubled in Strongholds and Cities.", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to Dodge by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. This effect is doubled in Strongholds and Cities%.$", "Øger din undvigechance med {1}% i {2}. Denne effekt fordobles i Fæstninger og Byer.", ". This effect is doubled in Strongholds and Cities.", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to critical with all Guns by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din chance for at ramme kritisk med alle Geværer med {1}%.", "Increases your chance to critical with all Guns by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your movement speed while in Cat Form by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and increases your chance to Dodge by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din bevægelseshastighed i Katteform med {1}%, og øger din Undvigelseschance med {2}%.", "Increases your movement speed while in Cat Form by ", "I"},
    {"^Instantly throw both weapons at all targets within ([%d%.,%-]+) yards, causing ([%d%.,%-]+)%% weapon damage%.$", "Kast øjeblikkeligt begge våben mod alle mål inden for {1} meter, hvilket påfører {2}% våbenskade.", "Instantly throw both weapons at all targets within ", "I"},
    {"^Lets out a mighty roar, increasing attack speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Udstøder et mægtigt brøl, der øger angrebshastigheden med {1}% i {2}.", "Lets out a mighty roar, increasing attack speed by ", "L"},
    {"^Movement speed reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.\nPhysical and magical damage dealt is reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "Bevægelseshastighed reduceret med {1}%.\nFysisk og magisk tilføjet skade er reduceret med {2}.", "%.\nPhysical and magical damage dealt is reduced by ", "M"},
    {"^Nature resistance reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%.  Holy and Nature spell damage taken increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Naturmodstand reduceret med {1}.  Modtagen hellig og natur-besværgelsesskade øget med {2}%.", ".  Holy and Nature spell damage taken increased by ", "N"},
    {"^Reduces the casting speed of nearby enemies by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and increases the time between their attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Reducerer nærliggende fjenders kastningshastighed med {1}%, og øger tiden mellem deres angreb med {2}%. Varer {3}.", "%, and increases the time between their attacks by ", "R"},
    {"^Slows the target, reducing their movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and their Mana, Rage, and Energy generation%.$", "Bremser målet, reducerer deres bevægelseshastighed med {1}% og deres generering af Mana, Vrede og Energi.", "Slows the target, reducing their movement speed by ", "S"},
    {"^Vulnerable and furious%.\n\nDamage taken increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.\nMelee haste increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Sårbar og rasende.\n\nModtaget skade øget med {1}%.\nNærkampshastighed øget med {2}%.", "Vulnerable and furious.\n\nDamage taken increased by ", "V"},
    {"^Your Poison and autoattack critical strikes have a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to grant you a combo point%.$", "Dine Gift- og autoangrebs kritiske angreb har en {1}% chance for at give dig et kombinationspunkt.", "Your Poison and autoattack critical strikes have a ", "Y"},
    {"^Your Shadow damage spells have a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to increase the Shadow damage you deal by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+), stacking up to ([%d%.,%-]+) times%.$", "Dine Skyggeskade-besværgelser har en chance på {1}% for at øge den Skyggeskade du forvolder med {2}% i {3}, og de kan stable op til {4} gange.", "% chance to increase the Shadow damage you deal by ", "Y"},
    {"^Your intellect is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+) and your chance to critically hit is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Din intellekt er øget med {1}, og din kritisk angrebschance er øget med {2}%.", " and your chance to critically hit is increased by ", "Y"},
    {"^Your spirit is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+) and your chance to critically hit is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Din ånd øges med {1}, og din chance for at give et kritisk slag øges med {2}%.", " and your chance to critically hit is increased by ", "Y"},
    {"^Your strength is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+) and your chance to critically hit is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Din styrke øges med {1}, og din chance for at give et kritisk slag øges med {2}%.", " and your chance to critically hit is increased by ", "Y"},
    {"^sound:%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Choose a sound to indicate your target has died$", "sound:[{1} - {2}] - Vælg en lyd, der angiver, at dit mål er død", "] - Choose a sound to indicate your target has died", "s"},
    {"^(.-) has been added to the group by the meeting stone%.$", "{1} er blevet føjet til gruppen af mødestenen.", " has been added to the group by the meeting stone.", ""},
    {"^(.-) mana regenerated every 5 seconds while in combat%.$", "{1} mana genoprettes hver 5 sekunder under kamp.", " mana regenerated every 5 seconds while in combat.", ""},
    {"^(.-) must complete Exile's Reach to accept that quest%.$", "{1} skal fuldføre Udstødtes Rækkevidde for at acceptere den opgave.", " must complete Exile's Reach to accept that quest.", ""},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+) Shadow damage inflicted every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%.\nAttack, cast, and movement speed reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "{1} Skyggeskade forvoldt hvert {2}. sek.\nAngrebs-, besværgelses- og bevægelseshastighed reduceret med {3}%.", " sec.\nAttack, cast, and movement speed reduced by ", ""},
    {"^A flaw in your defenses has reduced your armor by ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "En fejl i dit forsvar har reduceret din rustning med {1}.", "A flaw in your defenses has reduced your armor by ", "A"},
    {"^After upgrading this item, the Catalyst will need (.-) to recharge%.$", "Efter du opgraderer denne genstand, skal Katalysatoren bruge {1} for at lade op igen.", "After upgrading this item, the Catalyst will need ", "A"},
    {"^All damage taken reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and resistance to Dispel mechanics increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Al modtagen skade reduceret med {1}% og modstand mod Opløs-mekanikker øget med {2}%.", "% and resistance to Dispel mechanics increased by ", "A"},
    {"^Are you sure you want to craft this legendary for (.-)%?$", "Er du sikker på, at du vil fremstille denne legendariske for {1}?", "Are you sure you want to craft this legendary for ", "A"},
    {"^Are you sure you want to delete the equipment set (.-)%?$", "Er du sikker på, at du vil slette udstyrssættet {1}?", "Are you sure you want to delete the equipment set ", "A"},
    {"^Bitten by Darkspear Shark! Taking damage equal to ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your health every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%.$", "Bidt af Mørkspyd-haj! Modtager skade svarende til {1}% af dit helbred hvert {2} sek.", "Bitten by Darkspear Shark! Taking damage equal to ", "B"},
    {"^Choose the voice that says your (.-)%. This setting is saved per talent specialization%.$", "Vælg stemmen, der siger din {1}. Denne indstilling gemmes pr. talentspecialisering.", ". This setting is saved per talent specialization.", "C"},
    {"^Combat Audio Alert Say Target Health Voice set to (.-)$", "Kamp-lyd Advarsel Sig Mål-liv Stemme er sat til {1}", "Combat Audio Alert Say Target Health Voice set to ", "C"},
    {"^Combat Audio Alert Say Targets Casts Voice set to (.-)$", "Kamp-lyd Advarsel Sig Målenes Besværgelser Stemme er sat til {1}", "Combat Audio Alert Say Targets Casts Voice set to ", "C"},
    {"^Consume a delicious, hand%-picked apple to restore ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your maximum health instantly and another ([%d%.,%-]+)%% every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Indtag et lækkert, håndplukket æble for straks at genoprette {1}% af dit maksimale helbred og yderligere {2}% hvert {3} sek. i {4}.", "Consume a delicious, hand-picked apple to restore ", "C"},
    {"^Converts up to 10 Rage per second into health for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.  Each point of Rage is converted into ([%d%.,%-]+)%% health%.$", "Konverterer op til 10 Vrede pr. sekund til helbred i {1}.  Hvert point Vrede konverteres til {2}% helbred.", "Converts up to 10 Rage per second into health for ", "C"},
    {"^Enchants a weapon to have a 15%% chance to inflict ([%d%.,%-]+) Fire damage to all enemies within ([%d%.,%-]+) yards%.$", "Fortryller et våben, så det har en 15% chance for at forvolde {1} Ildskade til alle fjender inden for {2} meter.", "Enchants a weapon to have a 15% chance to inflict ", "E"},
    {"^Enraged%. Unstoppable and damage done increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Rasende. Ustoppelig og forvoldt skade øget med {1}%.", "Enraged. Unstoppable and damage done increased by ", "E"},
    {"^Improves your chance to hit with Arcane spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Forbedrer din angrebschance ved Arkan-besværgelser med {1}%.", "Improves your chance to hit with Arcane spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Improves your chance to hit with Shadow spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Forbedrer din angrebschance ved Skygge-besværgelser med {1}%.", "Improves your chance to hit with Shadow spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increase experience gained from slaying Undead by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øg den erfaring der opnås ved at dræbe Udøde med {1}% i {2}.", "Increase experience gained from slaying Undead by ", "I"},
    {"^Increase experience gained from slaying Undead by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øg den erfaring der opnås ved at dræbe Udøde med {1}%.", "Increase experience gained from slaying Undead by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases damage dealt by your Revenge ability by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skade tilføjet af din Hævn-evne med {1}%.", "Increases damage dealt by your Revenge ability by ", "I"},
