    {"^Increases the attack speed of the caster's pet by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger angrebshastigheden for udøverens kæledyr med {1}% i {2}.", "Increases the attack speed of the caster's pet by ", "I"},
