    {"^Decreases target's chance to hit with attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for ([%d%.,%-]+)%.$", "Mindsker målets træfchance med angreb med {1}% i {2}.", "Decreases target's chance to hit with attacks by ", "D"},
    {"^Decreases the rage cost of all Warrior shouts by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Mindsker raseriomkostningen for alle krigerens råb med {1}%.", "Decreases the rage cost of all Warrior shouts by ", "D"},
