    {"^Dodge chance increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. \nMaster's critical strike chance increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Chance for undvigelse øget med {1}%. \nMesterens chance for kritisk stød øget med {2}%.", "%. \nMaster's critical strike chance increased by ", "D"},
