    {"^Enemies Stunned by your Kidney Shot ability take ([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased damage from your poisons and attacks%.$", "Fjender, der er bedøvet af din Nyreskud-evne, tager {1}% øget skade fra dine gifte og angreb.", "Enemies Stunned by your Kidney Shot ability take ", "E"},
