    {"^Damage of Gahz'rilla Fang's effect increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Skade fra effekten af Gahz'hydra Hugtand øget med {1}%.", "Damage of Gahz'rilla Fang's effect increased by ", "D"},
