    {"^Your Serpent Sting damage is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your Attack Power over its normal duration%.$", "Din Slangebrod-skade øges med {1}% af din Angrebskraft over dens normale varighed.", "% of your Attack Power over its normal duration.", "Y"},
