    {"^Each time you Block an attack, you have a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to trigger your Maelstrom Weapon rune%.$", "Hver gang du blokerer et angreb, har du en {1}% chance for at udløse din Malstrømsvåben-rune.", "% chance to trigger your Maelstrom Weapon rune.", "E"},
    {"^Fire Blast critical strike chance increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Ildsprængnings kritiske angrebschance øget med {1}%.", "Fire Blast critical strike chance increased by ", "F"},
    {"^Gives you a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to deal ([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased Physical damage for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+) after being the victim of any damaging attack%.$", "Giver dig en {1}% chance for at tilføje {2}% øget Fysisk skade i {3}, efter du har været offer for et skadende angreb.", " after being the victim of any damaging attack.", "G"},
    {"^Granted ([%d%.,%-]+) strength, ([%d%.,%-]+) agility, ([%d%.,%-]+) attack power, ([%d%.,%-]+) ranged attack power, ([%d%.,%-]+)%% critical strike with all spells and attacks, ([%d%.,%-]+)%% melee and ranged haste, and ([%d%.,%-]+) armor penetration%.$", "Givet {1} styrke, {2} smidighed, {3} angrebskraft, {4} distanceangrebskraft, {5}% kritisk angreb med alle besværgelser og angreb, {6}% nærkamps- og distancehastighed og {7} rustningsgennemtrængning.", "% critical strike with all spells and attacks, ", "G"},
    {"^If you remain in Cat Form for ([%d%.,%-]+) seconds, increase your Energy Regeneration by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Hvis du forbliver i Katteform i {1} sekunder, øges din Energiregeneration med {2}%.", " seconds, increase your Energy Regeneration by ", "I"},
    {"^If you remain in Cat Form for ([%d%.,%-]+) seconds, increase your Energy Regeneration by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and the damage of your Ferocious Bite by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Hvis du forbliver i Katteform i {1} sekunder, øges din Energiregeneration med {2}%, og skaden fra dit Voldsomt Bid med {3}%.", " seconds, increase your Energy Regeneration by ", "I"},
    {"^Immobilized%.\nTime between attacks increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Immobiliseret.\nTid mellem angreb øget med {1}%.", "Immobilized.\nTime between attacks increased by ", "I"},
    {"^Improves your chance to hit with all spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Forbedrer din angrebschance ved alle besværgelser med {1}%.", "Improves your chance to hit with all spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases all chronomantic healing you deal by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger al kronomantisk heling du forvolder med {1}%.", "Increases all chronomantic healing you deal by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases damage done by your next Starfire by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skade forvoldt af din næste Stjerneild med {1}%.", "Increases damage done by your next Starfire by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Health and Armor of your pets by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger livet og rustningen for dine kæledyr med {1}%.", "Increases the Health and Armor of your pets by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the Physical damage of the caster by ([%d%.,%-]+), but reduces movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. Lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger udøverens fysiske skade med {1}, men reducerer bevægelseshastigheden med {2}%. Varer {3}.", "Increases the Physical damage of the caster by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the attack speed of nearby allies by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger angrebshastigheden for nærliggende allierede med {1}% i {2}.", "Increases the attack speed of nearby allies by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the critical hit chance of spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger den kritiske angrebschance for besværgelser med {1}% i {2}.", "Increases the critical hit chance of spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage that the Infernal does by ([%d%.,%-]+), but decreases it's attack speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Øger den skade, Helvedes-dæmonen forvolder, med {1}, men mindsker dens angrebshastighed med {2}% i {3}.", "Increases the damage that the Infernal does by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the range of your damaging spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger rækkevidden for dine skadelige besværgelser med {1}%.", "Increases the range of your damaging spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to critical with Bows by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din chance for at ramme kritisk med Buer med {1}%.", "Increases your chance to critical with Bows by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your chance to critical with Guns by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din chance for at ramme kritisk med Geværer med {1}%.", "Increases your chance to critical with Guns by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your melee critical strike damage by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and your offhand weapon damage by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din kritiske nærkampsskade med {1}% og din bivåbenskade med {2}%.", "Increases your melee critical strike damage by ", "I"},
    {"^Inflicts ([%d%.,%-]+)  Shadowdamage to an enemy, then an additional ([%d%.,%-]+) Shadow damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%.\nUpon expiration, inflicts ([%d%.,%-]+) Shadow damage to players within ([%d%.,%-]+) yards%.$", "Påfører {1}  Skyggeskade til en fjende, derefter yderligere {2} skyggeskade hvert {3} sek.\nVed udløb påfører det {4} skyggeskade til spillere inden for {5} meter.", "  Shadowdamage to an enemy, then an additional ", "I"},
    {"^Inflicts ([%d%.,%-]+) Arcane damage to an enemy, then an additional ([%d%.,%-]+) damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%.\nUpon expiration, inflicts ([%d%.,%-]+) Arcane damage to players within ([%d%.,%-]+) yards%.$", "Påfører {1} arkanskade til en fjende, derefter yderligere {2} skade hvert {3} sek.\nVed udløb påfører det {4} arkanskade til spillere inden for {5} meter.", " Arcane damage to an enemy, then an additional ", "I"},
    {"^Launches a bolt of frost at the enemy, causing ([%d%.,%-]+) Frost damage and slowing movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Affyrer et frostlyn mod fjenden, hvilket påfører {1} Frostskade og bremser bevægelseshastigheden med {2}% i {3}.", "Launches a bolt of frost at the enemy, causing ", "L"},
    {"^Mana and health regeneration rate increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Mana- og helbredsregenerationshastighed øget med {1}%.", "Mana and health regeneration rate increased by ", "M"},
    {"^Mana regeneration increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.  ([%d%.,%-]+)%% Mana regeneration may continue while casting%.$", "Manaregeneration øget med {1}%.  {2}% manaregeneration kan fortsætte under støbning.", "% Mana regeneration may continue while casting.", "M"},
    {"^Melee attacks deal ([%d%.,%-]+) Fire additional damage against Frozen targets%.$", "Nærkampsangreb forvolder {1} ekstra Ildskade mod frosne mål.", " Fire additional damage against Frozen targets.", "M"},
    {"^Movement speed increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% in Silverpine Forest and Hillsbrad Foothills%.$", "Bevægelseshastighed øget med {1}% i Sølvfyrreskoven og Hillsbrad-forbjergene.", "% in Silverpine Forest and Hillsbrad Foothills.", "M"},
    {"^Movement speed increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.\nMelee, Ranged, and Spell Haste increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Bevægelseshastighed øget med {1}%.\nNærkamps-, distance- og besværgelseshastighed øget med {2}%.", "%.\nMelee, Ranged, and Spell Haste increased by ", "M"},
    {"^Movement speed increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.\nMelee, ranged, and spell haste increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Bevægelseshastighed øget med {1}%.\nNærkamps-, distance- og besværgelseshastighed øget med {2}%.", "%.\nMelee, ranged, and spell haste increased by ", "M"},
    {"^Movement speed reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.\n([%d%.,%-]+) damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) seconds%.\nIncreased damage from Vekniss Stings%.$", "Bevægelseshastighed reduceret med {1}%.\n{2} skade hver {3} sekunder.\nØget skade fra Veknis-stik.", " seconds.\nIncreased damage from Vekniss Stings.", "M"},
    {"^Reduces Arcane, and Nature resistances by ([%d%.,%-]+)%. Increases Arcane, and Nature damage taken by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer Arkan- og Natur-modstand med {1}. Øger modtagen Arkan- og Natur-skade med {2}%.", ". Increases Arcane, and Nature damage taken by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the Mana cost of Purify and Cleanse by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer manaomkostningen for Renselse og Rensning med {1}%.", "Reduces the Mana cost of Purify and Cleanse by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the casting speed of nearby enemies by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Reducerer nærliggende fjenders kastningshastighed med {1}% i {2}.", "Reduces the casting speed of nearby enemies by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the threat generated by your spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer trussel genereret af dine besværgelser med {1}%.", "Reduces the threat generated by your spells by ", "R"},
    {"^Ruptures the target, causing them to bleed for ([%d%.,%-]+)%% damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Flår målet op, så det blør og tager {1}% skade hver {2} sek. i {3}.", "Ruptures the target, causing them to bleed for ", "R"},
    {"^Shadow and Arcane resistances reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%.  Shadow and Arcane damage taken increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Skyggemodstand og Arkanmodstand reduceret med {1}.  Modtaget skygge- og arkanskade øget med {2}%.", ".  Shadow and Arcane damage taken increased by ", "S"},
    {"^The battle has ended%. This arena will close in (.-)$", "Slaget er slut. Denne arena lukker om {1}", "The battle has ended. This arena will close in ", "T"},
    {"^This appearance is only usable during holiday: (.-)%.$", "Dette udseende kan kun bruges under helligdagen: {1}.", "This appearance is only usable during holiday: ", "T"},
    {"^Unable to send chat to (.-) because your message contained reserved words%.$", "Kan ikke sende snak til {1}, fordi din besked indeholdt reserverede ord.", " because your message contained reserved words.", "U"},
    {"^Vishas is nearby%. Attack speed is increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Vishas er i nærheden. Angrebshastigheden øges med {1}%.", "Vishas is nearby. Attack speed is increased by ", "V"},
    {"^Weakened by flames%.\n\nDamage taken increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Svækket af flammer.\n\nModtaget skade øget med {1}%.", "Weakened by flames.\n\nDamage taken increased by ", "W"},
    {"^Welcome to (.-)%. Your instance lock is scheduled to expire in (.-) %(extended%)%.$", "Velkommen til {1}. Din forekomstlås udløber om {2} (forlænget).", ". Your instance lock is scheduled to expire in ", "W"},
    {"^When struck in combat has a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance of freezing the attacker in place for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. Can only occur once every ([%d%.,%-]+)roccooldown sec%.$", "Når den rammes i kamp, har den en {1}% chance for at fryse angriberen fast på stedet i {2}. Kan kun ske én gang hver {3}roccgenopladning sek.", "% chance of freezing the attacker in place for ", "W"},
    {"^You must earn ([%d%.,%-]+) more (.-) for the season in order to purchase that item%.$", "Du skal tjene {1} mere {2} i sæsonen for at købe den genstand.", " for the season in order to purchase that item.", "Y"},
    {"^Your Rake now deals its periodic damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec, increasing its total damage over time by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Din Rive forvolder nu sin periodiske skade hvert {1} sek., hvilket øger dens samlede skade over tid med {2}%.", " sec, increasing its total damage over time by ", "Y"},
    {"^%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Choose the volume to use to say your casts$", "[{1} - {2}] - Vælg lydstyrken der bruges til at sige dine besværgelser", "] - Choose the volume to use to say your casts", "["},
    {"^%[([%d%.,%-]+) %- ([%d%.,%-]+)%] %- Choose the wording to use to say your cast$", "[{1} - {2}] - Vælg ordlyden der bruges til at sige din besværgelse", "] - Choose the wording to use to say your cast", "["},
    {"^(.-) needs a lower average item level%. %(Requires: ([%d%.,%-]+)%. Currently ([%d%.,%-]+)%.%)$", "{1} skal have et lavere gennemsnitligt genstandsniveau. (Kræver: {2}. Aktuelt {3}.)", " needs a lower average item level. (Requires: ", ""},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+) Shadow damage inflicted every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.\nAttack, cast, and movement speed reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% while this is in effect%.$", "{1} Skyggeskade forvoldt hvert {2}. sek. i {3}.\nAngrebs-, besværgelses- og bevægelseshastighed reduceret med {4}%, mens dette er aktivt.", ".\nAttack, cast, and movement speed reduced by ", ""},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance on ranged hit to gain 1 extra attack%.$", "{1}% chance ved distanceangreb for at få 1 ekstra angreb.", "% chance on ranged hit to gain 1 extra attack.", ""},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+)%% increased damage to your Eviscerate ability%.$", "{1}% øget skade mod din Udtømning-evne.", "% increased damage to your Eviscerate ability.", ""},
    {"^([%d%.,%-]+)%% of all threat transferred to your protector%.$", "{1}% af al trussel overføres til din beskytter.", "% of all threat transferred to your protector.", ""},
    {"^A short%-range shot that deals ([%d%.,%-]+)%% weapon damage and disorients the target for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.  Any damage caused will remove the effect%.$", "Et kortrækkende skud der forvolder {1}% våbenskade og desorienterer målet i {2}.  Enhver forvoldt skade fjerner effekten.", "% weapon damage and disorients the target for ", "A"},
    {"^A total of (.-) was deposited last week from Guild Challenges$", "I alt {1} blev indsat i sidste uge fra Klanudfordringer", " was deposited last week from Guild Challenges", "A"},
    {"^Are you sure you want to equip your ship with (.-)%?$", "Er du sikker på, at du vil udstyre dit skib med {1}?", "Are you sure you want to equip your ship with ", "A"},
    {"^Are you sure you want to overwrite the outfit (.-)%?$", "Er du sikker på, at du vil overskrive kostumet {1}?", "Are you sure you want to overwrite the outfit ", "A"},
    {"^Cannot cast spells%.\nMovement speed reduced by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Kan ikke støbe besværgelser.\nBevægelseshastighed reduceret med {1}%.", "Cannot cast spells.\nMovement speed reduced by ", "C"},
    {"^Click Generate Link to create a link good for ([%d%.,%-]+) days%.$", "Klik på Generér Lænke for at oprette en lænke, der gælder i {1} dage.", "Click Generate Link to create a link good for ", "C"},
    {"^Concuss the target, slowing movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Rystehjerner målet og bremser bevægelseshastigheden med {1}% i {2}.", "Concuss the target, slowing movement speed by ", "C"},
    {"^Congratulations, you are a founding member of (.-)!  To leave, use /teamquit %[2v2, 3v3, 5v5%]%.$", "Tillykke, du er et stiftende medlem af {1}!  For at forlade, brug /teamquit [2v2, 3v3, 5v5].", "Congratulations, you are a founding member of ", "C"},
    {"^Congratulations, you are a founding member of (.-)!$", "Tillykke, du er et stiftende medlem af {1}!", "Congratulations, you are a founding member of ", "C"},
    {"^Continue the campaign by accepting the quest \"(.-)\" in (.-)%.$", "Fortsæt kampagnen ved at acceptere opgaven \"{1}\" i {2}.", "Continue the campaign by accepting the quest \"", "C"},
    {"^Do you really want to disband your arena team (.-)%?$", "Vil du virkelig opløse dit arenahold {1}?", "Do you really want to disband your arena team ", "D"},
    {"^Entangles nearby enemies in roots, inflicting ([%d%.,%-]+)  Nature damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%. and immobilizing it for up to (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Fanger nærliggende fjender i rødder, forvolder {1} Naturskade hver {2} sek. og immobiliserer dem i op til {3}.", "Entangles nearby enemies in roots, inflicting ", "E"},
    {"^Fires a poisoned arrow at a target inflicting ([%d%.,%-]+) Nature and ([%d%.,%-]+) Nature damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Skyder en forgiftet pil mod et mål, som påfører {1} naturskade og {2} naturskade hvert {3} sek. i {4}.", "Fires a poisoned arrow at a target inflicting ", "F"},
    {"^Granted ([%d%.,%-]+)%% critical strike with all spells and attacks%.$", "Givet {1}% kritisk angreb med alle besværgelser og angreb.", "% critical strike with all spells and attacks.", "G"},
    {"^Increases Stormstrike and Lava Lash damage by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%. This effect is increased to ([%d%.,%-]+)%% if using a two%-handed weapon%.$", "Øger skade fra Stormstød og Lavapisk med {1}%. Denne effekt øges til {2}%, hvis du bruger et tohåndsvåben.", "Increases Stormstrike and Lava Lash damage by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases Warlock's critical strike chance by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% while their Demon pet is active%.$", "Øger Hekselederens kritiske angrebschance med {1}%, mens deres Dæmon-kæledyr er aktivt.", "Increases Warlock's critical strike chance by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases all damage you and your pet deal by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% while your pet is active%.$", "Øger al skade du og dit kæledyr forvolder med {1}%, mens dit kæledyr er aktivt.", "Increases all damage you and your pet deal by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases damage caused by your Corruption by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skade forvoldt af din Fordærvelse med {1}%.", "Increases damage caused by your Corruption by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases damage taken from Vicious Strike by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%$", "Øger skade modtaget fra Grusomt Slag med {1}%$", "Increases damage taken from Vicious Strike by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases movement speed while in Cat Form by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger bevægelseshastighed i Katteform med {1}%.", "Increases movement speed while in Cat Form by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases swimming speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and allow's the druid to breathe underwater%.$", "Øger svømmehastigheden med {1}% og lader druiden ånde under vand.", "% and allow's the druid to breathe underwater.", "I"},
    {"^Increases the amount healed by your spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger den mængde dine besværgelser helbreder med {1}%.", "Increases the amount healed by your spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the casting speed of your spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% per piece of Timeworn armor equipped%.$", "Øger støbningshastigheden for dine besværgelser med {1}% pr. stykke udstyret Tidsslidt rustning.", "Increases the casting speed of your spells by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage dealt by your poisons by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and gives your poisons an additional ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to resist dispel effects%.$", "Øger skaden tilføjet af dine Gifte med {1}%, og giver dine Gifte en ekstra chance på {2}% for at modstå fjerneeffekter.", "Increases the damage dealt by your poisons by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the damage of Moonfire and Wrath by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden fra Månebrand og Vrede med {1}%.", "Increases the damage of Moonfire and Wrath by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases the range of your Mend Pet spell by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% and the effect by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.  Also reduces the cost by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger rækkevidden for din Lappe Kæledyrs-besværgelse med {1}% og effekten med {2}%.  Reducerer også omkostningen med {3}%.", "Increases the range of your Mend Pet spell by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your damage dealt against undead by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din forvoldte skade mod udøde med {1}%.", "Increases your damage dealt against undead by ", "I"},
    {"^Increases your off%-hand weapon damage by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, off%-hand Rage generation by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%, and chance to hit with off%-hand attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Øger din bivåbenskade med {1}%, bivåben-raseri-generering med {2}% og træfchance med bivåbenangreb med {3}%.", "%, and chance to hit with off-hand attacks by ", "I"},
    {"^Inflicts ([%d%.,%-]+)%% physical damage to the current enemy target%.$", "Påfører det nuværende fjendemål {1}% fysisk skade.", "% physical damage to the current enemy target.", "I"},
    {"^Instantly heal yourself for ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of you maximum health%. Useable in all forms%.$", "Helbred dig selv straks for {1}% af dit maksimale helbred. Kan bruges i alle former.", "% of you maximum health. Useable in all forms.", "I"},
    {"^Launches a bolt of frost at the enemy causing ([%d%.,%-]+) Frost damage and slowing movement speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Affyrer et frostlyn mod fjenden, der påfører {1} Frostskade og bremser bevægelseshastigheden med {2}% i {3}.", "Launches a bolt of frost at the enemy causing ", "L"},
    {"^Physical damage done in Cat Form increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Fysisk skade forvoldt i Katteform øget med {1}%.", "Physical damage done in Cat Form increased by ", "P"},
    {"^Reduces healing effects for nearby enemies by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Reducerer helbredelseseffekter for nærliggende fjender med {1}% i {2}.", "Reduces healing effects for nearby enemies by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the mana cost of all shapeshifting by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer manaomkostningen for alt skikkelsesskifte med {1}%.", "Reduces the mana cost of all shapeshifting by ", "R"},
    {"^Reduces the mana cost of your totem spells by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Reducerer manaomkostningen for dine totem-besværgelser med {1}%.", "Reduces the mana cost of your totem spells by ", "R"},
    {"^Shadow damage taken from Warlock increased by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Modtaget skyggeskade fra Hekseleder øget med {1}%.", "Shadow damage taken from Warlock increased by ", "S"},
    {"^Silences, inflicts ([%d%.,%-]+) Frost damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%., and reduces an enemy's attack speed by ([%d%.,%-]+)%% for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%.$", "Gør tavs, påfører {1} Frostskade hvert {2} sek. og reducerer en fjendes angrebshastighed med {3}% i {4}.", " sec., and reduces an enemy's attack speed by ", "S"},
    {"^Suffering ([%d%.,%-]+)%% of your maximum health as Fire damage every ([%d%.,%-]+) sec%.$", "Lider {1}% af dit maksimale liv som Ildskade hvert {2} sek.", "% of your maximum health as Fire damage every ", "S"},
    {"^Takes control of a humanoid enemy up to level ([%d%.,%-]+) for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%. and increases its maximum health by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Tager kontrol over en humanoid fjende op til niveau {1} i {2}. og øger dens maksimale liv med {3}%.", "Takes control of a humanoid enemy up to level ", "T"},
    {"^Your Blessing of Sanctuary also grants ([%d%.,%-]+)%% increase to all stats when cast on yourself%.$", "Din Fristedsvelsignelse giver også {1}% øgning til alle egenskaber, når den besværges på dig selv.", "% increase to all stats when cast on yourself.", "Y"},
    {"^Your Chain Heal jumps to ([%d%.,%-]+) additional targets and its magnitude reduces ([%d%.,%-]+)%% less per jump%.$", "Din Kædehelbred springer til {1} ekstra mål, og dens styrke aftager {2}% mindre pr. spring.", " additional targets and its magnitude reduces ", "Y"},
    {"^Your Drain Life is no longer channeled, lasts (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+) with a (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+) cooldown, costs ([%d%.,%-]+)%% more mana, and heals you for ([%d%.,%-]+)%% more each time it deals damage%.$", "Dit Dræn Liv er ikke længere kanaliseret, varer {1} med en genopladning på {2}, koster {3}% mere mana og heler dig for {4}% mere, hver gang det forvolder skade.", "Your Drain Life is no longer channeled, lasts ", "Y"},
    {"^Your War Game invitation has been declined by (.-)%.$", "Din invitation til Krigsspil er blevet afslået af {1}.", "Your War Game invitation has been declined by ", "Y"},
    {"^Your weekly chest will contain an \nItem Level ([%d%.,%-]+) reward%.$", "Din ugentlige kiste vil indeholde en \nGenstandsniveau {1} belønning.", "Your weekly chest will contain an \nItem Level ", "Y"},
