    {"^Shapeshifts into a serpent for (%d[%d%.,]*%s%a+)%., increasing attack damage by ([%d%.,%-]+), and increasing the time between attacks by ([%d%.,%-]+)%%%.$", "Forvandler dig til en slange i {1}., øger angrebsskaden med {2} og tiden mellem angreb med {3}%.", ", and increasing the time between attacks by ", "S"},
