    {"^While fishing with a Lure active, you have a ([%d%.,%-]+)%% chance to catch an extra fish%.$", "Mens du fisker med et aktivt Lokkemiddel, har du en {1}% chance for at fange en ekstra fisk.", "While fishing with a Lure active, you have a ", "W"},
